<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">43. Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">LUKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne Luka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mulumbe Waina wa Yesu Klistu walalembwa ne</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mulumbe walalembwa ne Luka ulamwambanga Yesu kuba Mupulushi Walaiwa wa Baislayeli, kayi kuba Mupulushi wa bantu bonse. Luka alambangeti “Mushimu Uswepa wa Lesa walamukuwa Yesu kwambeti alete Mulumbe kubantu bapenshi.” (4.18) Mulumbe uwu wesula ne bilayandikinga kubantu byonse. Nkani yakuba wakondwa yambwa tunkanda twingi mulibuku lya Luka, makamaka mubimpansha byakukutanguna bilambanga shakubwela kwatubili kwa Yesu, kayi ne shamapwililisho panyuma pakuntanta Kwilu. Mbili ya kukula nekumwaikila kwa lushomo lwa ciklistu panyuma pa kutanta kwilu Luka walakwamba tunkanda twingi muli libuku lya Ncito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bimpansha bya 2 ne 6 bikute nkani shingi shilacanikingamonga mbuli, Nyimbo sha bangelo, kufwakasha kwa bembeshi pakusemwa kwa Yesu, Yesu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa kacili musepela, mukoshano wa Musamaliya wankumbo. Kayi nkani ya mwana wataika. Mumulumbe wonse, cinene cilimo ni Mipailo, Mushimu Uswepa, cibela cabatukashi mumulimo wa Yesu kayi ne kulekelelwa bwipishi ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi yamakani</para>
  <para style="io1">Kusemwa ne kukula kwa Yohane Mubatishi, 1:5 mpaka 2:52.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mulumbe wa Yohane Mubatishi, 3:1-20.</para>
  <para style="io1">Lubatisho ne kusunkwa kwa Yesu, 3:21 mpaka 4:13.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mulimo wa Yesu mu Galileya, 4:14 mpaka 9:50.</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulwendo bwakufuma mu Galileya kuya ku Yelusalemu 9:51 mpaka 19:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Byalenshika mu Yelusalemu nsondo ya panyuma katanafwa 19:28 mpaka 23:56</para>
  <para style="io1">Kupunduka, kubonekela, kayi nekutanta Kwilu kwa Mwami, 24:53.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Teofilo Walemekwa, bantu bangi balelekesha kwambeti balembe sha makani abintu ibyo byalenshika pakati petu, <verse number="2" style="v"/>balalemba mbuli ncobalambilwa kuli bakamboni balabona bintu ibyo mpobyalatatikila kwinshika. abo ebalikukambauka Mulumbe uwo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pabintu byonse ibi ndalepushisha mwabuya, kufuma pacindi ncobyalatatika kwinshika, neco ndayeye kwambeti ndimulembele mbuli mobyakonkanilana. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ndenshici kwambeti mwinshibe cakubinga pali byonse mbyobalamwambila.</para>
  <para style="s">Mungelo lambanga sha kusemwa kwa Yohane mubatishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pacindi mwami Helode mpwalikuba muleli wacishi ca Yudeya kwalikuba shimilumbo walikukwiweti Sakaliya, wamukalikoto ka beshimilumbo ka Abija. Mukashendi Sakaliya walikuba Lisabeti wa mumukowa wa Aloni. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bonse babili balikuba bantu beshikunyumfwila Lesa, kayi bali kukonkela Milawo ne byonse Lesa mbyalikuyandeti babinse. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba nkabalikukutepo mwana, pakwinga Lisabeti walikuba cumba kayi balikuba balacekulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi, Sakaliya walikusebensa ncito yakendi yabushimilumbo mu Ng'anda ya Lesa. Pakwinga bwalikuba busuba bwalikoto lyakendi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino kwelana ne cinga ca beshimilumbo, balasala Sakaliya kwambeti ayenga mu Ng'anda ya Lesa kuya kutenta lubani. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pacindi Sakaliya mpwalikutenta lubani, likoto lya bantu balikuba pansa kabapaila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino mwakutayeyela Sakaliya walabona mungelo wa Mwami, kali wemana kulubasu lwalulyo lwanteme pali kutentelwa lubani. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Sakaliya walakankamana nekutina. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nsombi mungelo uyo walamwambileti, “Kotatina Sakaliya, Lesa lanyumfu kupaila kwakobe, neco mukashobe lisabeti nakakusemene mwana mutuloba ukamutumbe lineti Yohane. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nakakukondweleshe ne kukusangalasha cikamba, kayi bantu bangi naboyo nibakakondwe pacebo cakusemwa kwakendi. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pakwinga mwana uyo nakabe mukulene pamenso a Lesa, kayi nteshi akanwenga waini nambi byeshikukola. Nakakutenga ngofu sha Mushimu Uswepa nkacili mulibunda. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Uyu muntu nakenshisheti ba Isilayeli bangi bakabwele kuli Mwami Lesa wabo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yohane nakabe kuntangu kwa Mwami, kayi nakabe ne Mushimu nengofu mbuli shali kuba ne mushinshimi Eliya. Nakalete lunyufwano pakati pabana neba meshabo.”</para>
  <para style="q">“Nakasandule bantu batanyumfwili Lesa</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti bakabe ne miyeyo ya bantu balulama.</para>
  <para style="q">Nakabambe bantu ba Mwami kwambeti babenga balibambila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Sakaliya walepusha mungelo uyo, “Nomba nganjishibaconi kwambeti ncolambanga nicikenshike? Pakwinga ame ndacekulu neye mukashame lacekulu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mungelo usa walakumbuleti, ame njame Gabiliyeli. Nkute kwimana pamenso a Lesa cindi conse. Nendi elantumu kwambeti nkwambile bintu ibi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nomba pakwinga uliya kushoma mulumbe uyu ngondamba weti ukenshike pacindi celela, nube cibulu nteti ucikonshenga kwamba, mpaka ibi bintu bikenshike.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pacindi ico bantu balikupembelela Sakaliya balakankamana nkabepushanyeti nicani lamanta cindi citali mu Ng'anda ya Lesa? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino mpwalapula pansa nkalikucikonsha kwamba nabo. Nomba nabo balenshiba kwambeti labono cimboni mboni, popelapo walatatika kwamba ne makasa mbuli cibulu, neco walapitilisha kuba cibulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mpwalapwa masuba akusebensa mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, Sakaliya walaya kucomwabo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Lisabeti walemita, lino nkalikupulapula mu ng'anda kwamyenshi isanu nkambeti, <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Lesa lino lanyumfwili inkumbo pakunyinshileci lafunyu insoni shakame pamenso abantu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mungelo Gabiliyeli lambanga sha kusemwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mumwenshi wacisanu ne umo kufuma mpwalemita Lisabeti, Lesa walatuma mungelo Gabiliyeli ku munshi naumbi waku Galileya, walikukwiweti Nasaleti. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Walaya ku mulindu walikukwiweti Maliya. Maliya walikuba wamamikilwa kumutuloba lina lyakendi ni Yosefe wa mumukowa wa Dafeti. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mungelo mpwalashika kuli Maliya walambeti, mitende obe walelekwa ne Lesa. Lesa uli ne njobe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Maliya mpwalanyumfwa maswi a mungelo walatilimuka walipusha mumoyo wakendi eti, “Nikupa mitende kwamushobo cini uku?” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Popelapo mungelo walamwambileti, “Kotatina, Maliya; Pakwinga Lesa lakunyumfwili inkumbo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Bona nukemite ne kusema mwana mutuloba ukamutumbeti Yesu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nakabe mukulene</para>
  <para style="q">kayi nakakwiweti mwanendi Lesa wakwilu wapitapo.</para>
  <para style="q">Mwami Lesa nakamupe cipuna ca</para>
  <para style="q">bwami ca Dafeti. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nakabe Mwami wa ba Islaeli kucindi conse ne bwendeleshi bwakendi nteshi bukapwepo!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino, Maliya walamwipusha Mungelo eti, “Nomba ici ngacinshika econi ame nkana nkumanapo ne mutuloba?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mungelo walakumbuleti,</para>
  <para style="q">Mushimu Uswepa nukese palinjobe nengofu sha Lesa wapita byonse nishikakufwekelele. Neco mwana eshi akasemwe nakakwiweti waswepa,</para>
  <para style="q">Mwanendi Lesa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Bona mukwenu Lisabeti usa walikwambweti nkaseme, lino lapembelenga kuya kuba ne mwana mutuloba mubucembele bwakendi. Pakwinga ukute myenshi isanu ne umo kakute libunda. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pakwinga paliya ceshi cikamwalile Lesa.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Maliya walakumbuleti, “Kacinshika mbuli momulambili, pakwinga ame ndemusha wa Mwami.” Lino mungelo usa walamushiya.</para>
  <para style="s">Maliya lafwakashilinga Lisabeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba ang'ana, Maliya walanyamuka bulwendo bwakufwambana kuya kumusena wa milundu, kumunshi wa Yudeya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Walengila mung'anda ya Sakaliya nekumupa mutende Lisabeti. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pacindi Lisabeti mpwalanyumfwa mutende wa Maliya, mwana walatatika kunyanyala mwakukondwa mulibunda mwakendi. Lisabeti walesushiwa ne ngofu sha Mushimu Uswepa, <verse number="42" style="v"/>kayi walolobesha ne kwambeti, “Ukute colwe pakati pa batukashi bonse, kayi mwanobe weshi akasemwe walelekwa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Anu njame bani kwambeti mfwakashilwe ne banyina Mwami wakame? <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pakwinga mpondalanyumfowa mutende wenu, mwana walatatika kunyanyala mwakukondwa mulibunda mwakame. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ukute colwe pakwinga walashoma kwambeti makani Lesa ayo ngowalambilwa nakubinga nakenshike.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwimbo lwa Maliya lwa kulumbaisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Popelapo Maliya walalumbaisha nekwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ndalumbu Mwami mumoyo mwakame,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kayi mushimu wakame wakondwa muli Lesa</para>
  <para style="q">Mupulushi wakame.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Pakwinga labono kulicepesha kwakame ndemusha wakendi</para>
  <para style="q">kufuma lelo,</para>
  <para style="q">bantu bonse pacishi ca panshi nibakankuweti walelekwa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Pakwinga nendi Lesa wangofu shonse lanjinshili bintu binene,</para>
  <para style="q">lina lyakendi lyaswepa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kayi inkumbo shakendi shili pali bonse bantu abo bakute kumulemeka kufuma kumusemano</para>
  <para style="q">kushika kumusemano naumbi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Likasa lyakendi lilenshi bintu binene byangofu byeshi kukankamanisha,</para>
  <para style="q">lamwaya bantu bakute miyeyo ya kulisumpula.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Lafunyu Bami bangofu shinene pabipuna byabo,</para>
  <para style="q">nekusumpula abo beshi kulicepesha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lapa bantu bakute nsala bintu bingi kwambeti bekute,</para>
  <para style="q">Lababweshe babile kwakubula kubapapo kantu kalikonse.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lanyamfwa Islaeli musebenshi wakendi</para>
  <para style="q">kayi uliya kuluba kumwinshila inkumbo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>mbuli ncalalaya bamashali betu bakulukulu,</para>
  <para style="q">Abulahamu ne bashikulu bakendi mpaka muyayaya.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Maliya walekala ne Lisabeti myenshi yanda kukwana itatu, panyuma pakendi walabwelela kucomwabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Kusemwa kwa Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Lino cindi cakwambeti Lisabeti atumbuke calakwana, walasema mwana mutuloba. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Beshikamukowa ne banendi mpobalanyufwa mbuli Mwami ncalamubela inkumbo Lisabeti balakondwa pamo bonse ne ndiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mwana usa mpwalakwanisha nsondo ne busuba bumo balesa kwambeti bamwelule, kayi bamutumbe lina lyabaishi ba Sakaliya, <verse number="60" style="v"/>nsombi banyina balakana kwambeti, “Welela kukwiweti Yohane.” <verse number="61" style="v"/>Balo bantu balamukumbuleti, “Nomba kuliyawa ukute lina lyamushoboyo kubeshi kamukowa.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Lino balambila baishi ne makasa, ne kubepusheti, “Mulandanga tumutumbe lina cini?” <verse number="63" style="v"/>Popelapo Sakaliya walasebensesha makasa pakusenga cakulembelapo, ne kulembeti, “Lina lyakendi ni Yohane.” Bantu bonse balakankamana. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Mpwalapwishowa kulemba Sakaliya walatatika kwamba, nekutatika kulumbaisha Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balatina abo balikuba bekala pepi nendiye. Neco lulumbi ulo lwalamwaika mucishi conse ca tulundu twa mu Yudeya. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Bonse abo balanyufwa mulumbe uyo bali kabayeya mumyoyo yabo kayi ne kulipusheti, “Uyu mwana nakabe wamushobo cini?” Pakwinga cilabonekelenga limo kwambeti ngofu sha Lesa shili pali endiye.</para>
  <para style="s">Sakaliya lalumbaishinga Mwami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Lino Sakaliya baishi Yohane, walesushiwa ne ngofu sha Mushimu Uswepa nekutatika kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Alumbaishiwe Mwami Lesa wa ba Islaeli,</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga Lesa lanyamfwa bantu bakendi ne kubapulusha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Latupa mupulushi ukute ngofu,</para>
  <para style="q">walafuma mulibunda lya Dafeti musebenshi wa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Ibi walabyambila limo</para>
  <para style="q">kupitila mubashinshimi bakendi baswepa bakeendi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Kwambeti nakatupulushe kufuma mumakasa abalwani betu,</para>
  <para style="q">ne kuli abo bonse batupata.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Walambeti, nakanyumfwile inkumbo bamashali betu bakeendi,</para>
  <para style="q">kayi nteshi akalubeko cipangano cakendi caswepa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Ncalalumbila kumushali wetu Abulahamu ne kumushomesheti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>nakatupulushe mumakasa abalwani betu,</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti tukamusebensele mwakubula buyowa,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>Kayi tube baswepa nekuba balulama pamenso akendi,</para>
  <para style="q">masuba onse abuyumi bwetu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>Lino mwana obe,</para>
  <para style="q">nukakwiweti mushinshimi wa Lesa wa wangofu shonse,</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga obe nukabe pantangu pa Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q">akumubambila nshila.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>Nukenshibishe bantu bakendi kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">nibakapulushiwe kayi nekulekelelwa bwipishi bwabo.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>Mwami Lesa wetu ukute nkumbo nakatupe</para>
  <para style="q">mumuni wa kwilu ulyeti</para>
  <para style="q">kutubuluka kwa kumaca.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>nukabe mumuni weti ukamunikile bantu bonse</para>
  <para style="q">bekala mu mushinshe wa lufu,</para>
  <para style="q">nekututangunina mulumuno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Usa mwana Yohani walakula nekushimpa mumushimu. Walekala mucinyika kushikila busuba mpwalabonekela patuba kubantu mu Isilaeli.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kusemwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateyo 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Masuba ayo Agasita, mwami waku Loma walabika mulawo wakwambeti bantu bonse bali mubulelo bwa Loma balembwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uku kwalikuba kulembesha kwakuyamba kwalenshika cindi Kwilinyasi mpwalikuba mwendeleshi wa cishi ca Siliya. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino bonse bantu balaya akulembesha umo ne umo kumunshi kucomwabo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yosefe neye walanyamuka kufuma ku Nasaleti munshi walikuba mucimpansha ca Galileya kuya kumunshi wa Dafeti, uko kwali kukwiweti Betelehemu, mucishi ca Yudeya, pakwinga walikuba wamulibunda lya Dafeti. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Walaya pamo ne Maliya uyo ngwalikuba wamamikila, kwambeti naboyo baye balembwe. Cindi ico Maliya walikuba wemita. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kabacili kopeloko masuba akwambeti Maliya apulukemo alakwana, <verse number="7" style="v"/>walasema mwana wakwiya mutuloba. Walamupetelesha mubikwisa ne kumoneka mucibaya mwali kulyela ng'ombe, pakwinga nkakwalikuba musena mu ng'anda ya bensu.</para>
  <para style="s">Bangelo balenshibishinga bembeshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kucishi kopeloko kwalikuba bembeshi balikwembela mbelele shabo mashiku.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="02 Shepherds.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="2:8">Bembeshi balembelenga litanga lya mbelele</figure> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwakutayeyela, mungelo wa Mwami walabonekela kuli endibo. Kubala kwa bulemeneno bwa Mwami kwalabamunikila tuu! Lino balatina. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba mungelo walabambileti, “Kamutatina pakwinga ndalete Mulumbe Waina weti ukondweleshe bantu bonse. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mashiku alelo mumunshi wa mwami Dafeti mulasemwe Mupulushi wenu wananikwa uyo walaiwa, Klistu endiye Mwami. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino cishibisho cakendi nici; Nimuye mucane mwana kateta wafungailwa mubikwisa kaliwona mucibaya mwakulyela ng'ombe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mwakutayeyela kwalabonekela likoto lya bangelo bangi ba kwilu pamo ne mungelo usa bali kulumbaisha Lesa kabambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Alumbwe Lesa wa kwilu wapitapo kayi panshi</para>
  <para style="q">pabe lumuno pakati pa bantu</para>
  <para style="q">Lesa mbakondwa nabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bangelo balabwelela kwilu, lino bembeshi balatatika kwambilaneti, “Katuyani tushikeko ku Betelehemu tuye tubone cilenshiki ico ncalatwambili Mwami.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino balaya mwakufwambana, nekucana Maliya ne Yosefu boneka mwana mucibaya mwalikulyela ng'ombe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpobalamubona, bembeshi basa balabamba byonse mbyalabambila mungelo usa pamwana walasemwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Bonse balanyumfwa makani ayo alambwa ne bembeshi balakankamana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Maliya walapitilisha kubyanuka bintu byonse ibi kayi walinkabiyeyapo mumoyo wakendi cindi conse. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bembeshi basa balabwelela, nkabalemeka nekulumbaisha Lesa pabyonse mbyobalanyufwa nekubona. Calenshika ndendende mbuli mwalabambilila Mungelo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latumbwanga lina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana usa mpwalakwanisha masuba asanu ne atatu balamwelula nekumutumba lineti Yesu. Lina ndyalamba mungelo, Yesu nkatana aba mulibunda lyabanyina.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamutwalanga mu Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpocalashika cindi cakwambeti, Yosefe ne maliya bense mwambo wakuswepesha pakukonka Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose, mwanoyo balaya nendi ku Yelusalemu kwambeti bamubenge kuli Mwami. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pakwinga calembwa mu Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose kwambeti, “Mwana uliyense mutuloba, wakwiya welela kubengwa kuli Lesa.” <verse number="24" style="v"/>Balaya akubenga mulumbo wa nkulimba shibili nambi bana ba baciba babili kwelana mbuli calembwa mu Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Mose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino mu Yelusalemu mwalikuba muntu walikukwiweti Simyoni, walikuba muntu walikutina Lesa. kayi Mushimu Uswepa walikuba pali endiye. Walikupembelela cindi cakwambeti Lesa akapulushe Baislaeli. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa walamuyubulwila kwambeti nteshi akafwe nkatanabona Klistu mupulushi walaiwa ne Lesa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Busuba bumbi Mushimu Uswepa walamwambila simyoni kwambeti ayenga kung'anda ya Lesa. Bamashali ba Yesu balengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa ne mwana kwambeti bamwinshile mwambo wa Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Mose. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Popelapo Simyoni walatambula mwana nekumufukatila mumakasa mwakendi ne kulumbaisha Lesa ne maswi akwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Mwami, lino ndekeni ame musebenshi wenu,</para>
  <para style="q">njenga mulumuno,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga mulenshi ncomwalanshomesha.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pakwinga menso akame alabono lupulusho lwenu,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>lupulusho ulo ndomwalabamba, pamenso abantu bonse.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Uyu ni mumuni walambweti nukamunikile bantu ba mishobo naimbi,</para>
  <para style="q">nekwambeti pakabe bulemeneno pa bantu benu Ba isilayeli.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Baishi ne banyina balakankamana mpobalanyumfwa maswi ngalamba Simyoni pa mwana uyu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino Simyoni walabaleleka nekwambila Maliya banyina mwana eti, uyu mwana walasalwa ne Lesa,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kwambeti awishe</para>
  <para style="q">ne kupundusha bangi pakati pa bantu ba mu Islayeli.</para>
  <para style="q">Nakabe cishibisho catumwa ne Lesa,</para>
  <para style="q">ico bantu bangi ncoti bakakane.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Neco miyeyo ili mumyoyo yabantu bangi,</para>
  <para style="q">nikabonekele patuba.</para>
  <para style="q">Nenjobe Maliya mapensho nakakwikate ne kuyasa</para>
  <para style="q">kumuyo eti cibeshi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kayi kwalikuba mushinshimi mutukashi mukalibingi lina lyakendi ni Ana. Walikuba mwanendi Faniwelo wa mulibunda lya Asha uyo walekala ne baibendi byaka bisanu ne bibili, Lino neye walikuba mucembele. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Pacindi co walikuba ne byaka makumi asanu ne atatu kayi ne byaka bina. Cindi conse walikwikala mu Ng'anda ya Lesa. Walikapaila kuli Lesa mashiku ne munshi kayi ni muntu walikulikanisha kulya. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nendi mpwalashikako copeleco cindi, walatatika kulumbaisha Lesa, kambila bantu bonse sha mwana uyo ngobalikupembelela cindi Lesa mposhi akapulushe Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="s">Labwelelenga ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yosefe ne Maliya mpobalapwisha kwinsa byonse kwelana ne Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose, balabwelela kucomwabo ku Nasaleti mucishi ca Galileya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mwana usa walakula nekuba ne ngofu kayi walaba ne mano. Neco Lesa walamuleleka.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne beshikwiyisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Bashali ba Yesu balikuya lyonse ku Yelusalemu mwaka ne mwaka akusekelela Pasika. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalaba ne myaka likumi ne ibili, balaya kopeloko mbuli cinga cabo. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Mpobalapwisha kusekelela bala bwelela kucomwabo, Yesu walashala ku Yelusalemu, bashali bakendi nkabalenshiba. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Balo bashali bakendi bali kabayeyeti uli mulikoto lya bantu mbobali kuyanabo munshila, balenda musuma wa busuba bumo. Lino balatatika kumuyandaula kubamakwabo ne kubanabo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mpobalacaneti kuliyawa, balabwelela ku Yelusalemu kabaya akumulangola. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Balamucana mpopalapita masuba atatu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, nkali ekala pakati pa beshikwiyisha, nkanyumfwila maswi abo kayi nkabepusha mipusho. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana mpobalanyufwa mbuli mwalikubakumbulila ne mano. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Bashali bakendi mpobalamubona balakankamana. Lino banyina balamwipusheti, “Mwana obe, ulatwinshili cani cisa? Bona ame ne baiso tulashupiki kukuyandola.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Nomba nkamundangwela cani, sena nkamucishi kwambeti ndelela kuba mung'anda ya Bata?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Balo baliya kunyufwishisha ncalabakumbula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walanyamuka nekuya nabo kucomwabo ku Nasaleti pakwinga walikunyumfwila banyina. Maliya walasunga bintu ibi byonse mumoyo wakendi. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu walakula necimo ca mano kayi walaba mwana weshi kukondwelesha Lesa nebantu bonse.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kukambauka kwa Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyo 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohane 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mu mwaka walikumi ne cisanu Tibelyo, mwami wa ku Loma. Pontiyasi Pilato pacindi ico walikuba emuleli wacishi ca Yudeya. Helodi neye walikuba muleli wa cishi ca Galileya. Filipo mukwabo Helodi, walikendelesha cishi ca Ituliya ne Tilakoniti. Lisaniya walikuba emuleli wa cishi ca Abilini. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pa cindico Anasi ne Kayafa balikuba beshimilumbo bamakulene. Pacindi copeleci Lesa walamupa mulumbe Yohane mwanendi Sakaliya mucinyika. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Popelapo Yohane walaya akukambauka muminshi yonse yalikuba yashunguluka mulonga wa Yolodani, kabambileti, “Sandukani mu myoyo yenu, mubatishiwe, kwambeti Lesa amulekelele bwipishi bwenu.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ibi embyalamba mushinshimi Yesaya eti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Muntu labilikishinga mucinyika lambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">‘Kamubamba nshila ya mwami.</para>
  <para style="q">Kamululamika nshila yakendi.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Misena yonse yakunama nikafukilwe,</para>
  <para style="q">milundu ne bina byonse nibikacepeshewe.</para>
  <para style="q">Nshila shapetuka petuka nishikalulamikwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Sha byeshikupuntula nishikaswepe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino mishobo yonse ya bantu nikabone lupulusho lwa Lesa!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balaya nkwalikuba Yohane kwambeti enga ababatishe. Nomba nendi walabambileti, “Amwe omulyeti njoka, niyani lamucenjeshe kufwamba bukalu bwa Lesa bulesanga? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kamwinsani milimo yaina yeshikulesha kwambeti mulasanduku myoyo yenu. Kamutambangeti, mwalulama pakwinga Abulahamu. ebameshenu. Ndamwambilinga Lesa ngausandula mabwe aya kuba banabendi Abulahamu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba lino kembe kakankwa kendi pamiyanda ya bitondo. Neco citondo cili conse citaseme bisepo byaina, nicikatemwe nekuciwala pamulilo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba bantu balamwipusha Yohane eti, “Nomba lino twinse aconi?” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nendi Yohane walambeti, “Uyo ukute byakulya apeko munendi wabula. Neye ukute byakufwala ense copeleco.” <verse number="12" style="v"/>Naboyo beshimisonko balikuyanda kubatishiwa, balamwipusha Yohane eti, “Shikwiyisha, nomba twinsenga cani?” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nendi Yohane walabambileti, “Mutasonkeshanga mwelo wapitilila.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Naboyo bashilikali balamwipusheti, “Nomba twinsenga cani?” Nendi Yohane walabambileti, “Mutalamunanga muntu cintu cakendi pakumuyosha nambi kumunanika mulandu. Amwe mali ngomulafolonga amukwanine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pakwinga pacindici bantu bangi balikupembelela kwisa kwa Mupulushi Walaiwa ne Lesa, bantu balatatika kuyeyeti mpani Yohane eMupulushi usa Walaiwa ne Lesa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino Yohane walabambila bonseti, “Ame ndamubatishinga ne menshi, nsombi lesanga wampita kayi nkandela kucikonsha kuba musha wakendi uyo wela kusungulula ntambo sha nkwabilo shakendi. Uyo nendi naka mubatishenga ne Mushimu Uswepa ne mulilo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nendi ukute cakupupulushilako maila mumakasa akendi kwambeti apupulushe nekwalongela mulyanga, Lino nakatente bungu bonse mumulilo utashimiki.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yohane walikukambauka Mulumbe Waina nekubacenjesha munshila shapusa pusana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nomba Yohane walakalalila mwami Helodi pacebo cakweba Helodyasi, muka mukwabo, ne pacebo ca bintu byaipa nabimbi mbyalikwinsa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kusankanya pabwipishi ubu, Helode walamusunga Yohane mujele.</para>
  <para style="s">Kubatishiwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateyo 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi bantu bonse mpobalabatishiwa, neye Yesu walabatishiwa. Lino pacindi mpwali kupaila kwilu kwalacaluka, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kai ne Mushimu Uswepa walikuboneketi nkulimba walaseluka nekwisa kwikala pali endiye. Ne liswi lyalanyumfwika kwilu eti, “Njobe mwaname ngonsuni mumoyo mwakame, pali njobe ndakondwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Bashali ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateyo 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesu walatatika incito yakendi yakwiyisha nkali ne myaka makumi atatu. Bantu balikumwambeti nimwana wa Yosefe, uyo walikuba mwana wa Eli, <verse number="24" style="v"/>Eli mwanendi Matati, Matati mwanendi Levi, Levi mwanendi Meliki, Meliki mwanendi janai, Janai mwanendi Yosefe, <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yosefe mwanendi Matayasi, Matayasi mwanendi Amosi, Amosi mwanendi Nahumu, Nahumu mwanendi Esili, Esili mwanendi Nagai, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nagai mwanendi Mahati, Mahati mwanendi Matatiyasi, Matatiyasi mwanendi Semeine, Semeine mwanendi Yoseki, Yoseki mwanendi Yoda, <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yoda Mwanendi Yowanani, Yowanani mwanendi Lesa, Lesa mwanendi Zelubabelo, Zelubabelo mwanendi Seyalatyelo, Seyalatyelo mwanendi Neli, <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neli mwanendi Meluki, Meluki mwanendi Adi, Adi mwanendi Kosamu, Kosamu mwanendi Elimadamu, Elimadamu mwanendi Ele, <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ele mwanendi Yoshiwa, Yoshiwa mwanendi Eliyaza, Eliyaza mwanendi Yolimu, Yolimu mwanendi Matati, Matati mwanendi Levi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Levi mwanendi Simyoni, Simyoni mwanendi Yudasi, Yudasi mwanendi Yosefe, Yosefe, mwanendi Yonamu, Yonamu mwanendi Eliyakimu, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Eliyakimu mwanendi Meliya, Meliya mwanendi Mena, Mena mwanendi Matata, Matata mwanendi Natamu, Natamu mwanendi Dafeti, <verse number="32" style="v"/>Dafeti mwanendi Yese, Yese mwanendi Obedi, Obedi mwanendi Bowasi, Bowasi mwanendi Sala, Sala mwanendi Nasoni, <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nasoni mwanendi Aminadabu, Aminadabu mwanendi Adimini, Adimini mwanendi Ani, Ani mwanendi Hesiloni, Hesiloni mwanendi Pelesi, Pelesi mwanendi Yuda, <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yuda mwanendi Yakobo, Yakobo mwanendi Isaki, Isaki mwanendi Abulahamu, Abulahamu mwanendi Tela, Tela mwanendi Naholi, <verse number="35" style="v"/>Naholi mwanendi Selaki, Selaki mwanendi Leu, Leu mwanendi Pelegi, Pelegi mwanendi Eba, Eba mwanendi Sela, <verse number="36" style="v"/>Sela mwanendi Kainani, Kainani mwanendi Alifakisadi, Alifakisadi mwanendi Semu, Semu mwanendi Nowa, Nowa mwanendi Lameki, <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lameki mwanendi Metusela, Metusela mwanendi Enoki, Enoki mwanendi Yaledi, Yaledi mwanendi Mahalale, Mahalale mwanendi Kenani, <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kenani mwanendi Enosi, Enosi mwanendi Seti, Seti mwanendi Adamu, Adamu mwanendi Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Satana lasunkunga Yesu.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateyo 4:1-11</ref>; Maliko 1:12-13 )</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walafumako kumulonga wa Yolodani kaliwesula ne Mushimu Uswepa. Kayi Mushimu Uswepa walamutangunina kuya mucinyika, <verse number="2" style="v"/>umo mucinyika walekalamo masuba makumi ana kasunkwa ne Satana, kayi nkalalyapo kantu kalikonse. Lino masubayo mpwalapwa Yesu walanyumfwa nsala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Satana walamwambileti, “Na njobe mwanendi Lesa, ambila libwe ili lisanduke shinkwa.” <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Calembwa mu Maswi a Lesa eti, muntu nkela kuba ne buyumi mubyakulya byonka.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kufumapo Satana walamumanta Yesu nekumutwala pa mulundu nekumulesha bwami bonse bwa mu cishi ca panshi mucindi cing'ana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino Satana walambila Yesu eti, “Ubu bonse bwami ne bulemu bwakendi ngankupa, pakwinga bonse bwalapewa kuli njame. Nkute ngofu shakupa muntu ngonsuni. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino ndakwambilinga na umfukamine ekwambeti, bonse bulelo ubu nibube bwakobe.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Calembwa mu Maswi a Lesa eti, fukamina Mwami Lesa wakobe enka nekumusebensela!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kumapwilisho Satana walamutwala Yesu ku Yelusalemu nekumubika pa Ng'anda ya Lesa. Nekumwambileti, “Na omwanendi Lesa liwale panshi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>pakwinga calembwa mu Maswi a Lesa eti, ‘Lesa nakatume bangelo bakendi kwambeti bakutabe,’ <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nibakakubake mumakasa</para>
  <para style="q">“Kwambeti utalilinga kucimpanta cakobe pamabwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walambeti, “Calembwa mu Maswi a Lesa eti, ‘Utasunka Mwami, Lesa wakobe.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba Satana mpwalapwisha kumusunka Yesu munshila iliyonse, walamushiya kwambeti akamukonke cindi nacimbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latatikinga incito yakendi mu Galileya.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateyo 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walabwelela ku Galileya kakute ngofu sha Mushimu Uswepa. Lulumbi lwakendi lwalaya mucishi conseco. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Walikeyisha mumanda akupaililamo aba Yuda, kayi bantu bonse balamulemeka.</para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balamukananga Yesu ku Nasaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateyo 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walaya ku Nasaleti uko nkwalakulila. Kayi pabusuba bwa Sabata walengila mung'anda yakupaililamo, pakwinga ecalikuba cinga cakendi, walemana kwambeti abelenge Maswi, <verse number="17" style="v"/>balamupa libuku lya mushinshimi Yesaya. Lino neye walacalula libuku ilyo nekucana palembweti,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Mushimu wa Mwami Lesa uli pali njame.</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga lansala kwambeti ndibambile mulumbe waina bapenshi.</para>
  <para style="q">Lantumu kwambeti ndibambile basungwa eti basungululwe,</para>
  <para style="q">bampofu babone,</para>
  <para style="q">bantu bashantililwa balubulwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi lantumu kuya kubambileti,</para>
  <para style="q">cindi cilashiki ncoti Lesa akapulushe bantu bakendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha walifweka libuku nekupa shimilumbo wa mung'anda yakupaililamo yaba Yuda, nekwikala panshi. Bantu bonse balikuba mung'anda balamulangilisha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Lelo maswi awa ngomulanyumfu alakwanilishiwa” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balamulumbaisha kayi balakankamana ne maswi ngalikwamba mwamano, neco bantu balambeti “Sena uyu nte mwanendi Yosefe?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Cancinencine nimukambengeti, ‘mung'anga, lipulushe wenka.’ Kayi nimukambengeti, ‘Twalanyumfwa ncowalensa ku Kapelenawo,nako kuno lino linshile omwine.’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, mushinshimi nkakute kutambulwa cena ne bantu bakumunshi kucomwabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Lino kamunyufwani, mumasuba a Eliya kwalikuba ba mukalubingi bangi balikuyanda lunyamfwo mu Isilaeli, mpokwalaba cilala kwa myaka itatu ne myenshi isanu ne umo mpokwalaba nsala mucishi conse. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Eliya uliya kutumwapo kumuntu uliyense palibasa bonse mu Islayeli, nsombi walatumwa ku mukalubingi mutukashi wakumunshi wa Zalefati, mucishi ca Sidoni. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Palikuba bantu bangi balikukolwa bulwashi bwamankuntu mu Isilaeli mumasuba amushinshimi Elisha. Nsombi Namani enka wa ku Siliya ewalasengulwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpobalanyumfweco, bantu bonse balikuba mung'anda yakupaililamo balakalala. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Popelapo balanyamuka nekumukwekwanya kumufunya mumushi usa, nekumutwala pa mulundu mpobalikuba bebaka munshi wabo kwambeti bamuwale panshi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walapita pakati pa bantu nekuya.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu wekatwa ne mushimu waipa.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Maliko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walaya ku Kapelenawo, mumunshi wa mucishi ca Galileya walikayisha bantu pabusuba bwa Sabata. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kwiyisha kwakendi, kwalekata myoyo yabantu pakwinga maswi akendi alalesha kwambeti akute ngofu sha bwendeleshi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mung'anda yakupailila mwalikuba muntu walikuba wekatwa ne mushimu waipa walolobesha ne liswi lyapelu eti, <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Anu tulamwinshi cani amwe Yesu wa ku Nasaleti? Sena mulesa kutononga? Ndamwinshibi njamwe Waswepa mutumwa wa Lesa!” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walakalalila mushimu waipa eti, “Mwena, fuma mu muntuyu!” Neco mushimu waipa walamuwisha panshi pakati pa bantu nekufuma muli endiye cakubula kumulingapo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana nekwipushanyeti, “Anu ni maswi cini aya cakubinga nendi lambilinga mishimu yaipa cangofu nayoyo ilamunyumfwilinga nekufumamo.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Neco lulumbi lwakendi lwalanyumfwika mumisena yonse yashunguluka cishi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga balwashi bangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateyo 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walafumako ku ng'anda yakupaililamo nekuya ku ng'anda ya Shimoni. Kumakwendi Shimoni batukashi balikuba balwashi cimpwita. Lino bantu balasenga Yesu eti abashilike. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walaya kwimana pepi nendiye walakalalila cimpwita, kofuma, cindi copeleco cimpwita calapwa. Kumakwendi abo balapunduka nekutatika kubabambila byakulya. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lisuba mpolyalebila abo balikukute banabo balikuba ne malwashi apusana pusana, balabaleta kwalikuba Yesu. Walabekata ne makasa bonse balwashi, popelapo balaba cena. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nayo mishimu yaipa yalikufuma mubantu bangi kayolobesheti, “Njobe mwanendi Lesa!”</para>
  <para style="p">Nsombi nendi walaikalalila ne kwikanisha kwamba pakwinga yalikumwishibeti ni wasalwa wa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lenga akukambauka mucishi ca Yudeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Maliko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca Yesu walafuma ku Kapelenawo nekuya kubusena kwalikubula kwikala bantu. Bantu balatatika kumuyandaula, mpobalamucana balelesha kumusenga camakasa abili kwambeti ataya kumbi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi walabakumbuleti, “Ndelela kukambauka Mulumbe Waina wa Bwami bwa Lesa kuminshi imbi pakwinga encito njalantuma Lesa.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Neco walikukambauka mumanda akupaililamo aku Yudeya onse.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakunga beshikwiya bakutanguna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateyo 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi Yesu walikuba wemana mumbali mwa lwenje lwa Genesaleti. Bantu bangi bali kabanyakana kwambeti banyumfwe Maswi a Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabona mato abili asungwa mumbali, beshikushina inswi balikuba balafumumo kabasuka tombe twabo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walengila mubwato bumo ubo bwalikuba bwa Shimoni, neye walasengeti abunyakileko pa lwenje. Walekala mubwato nekutatika kwiyisha bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mpwalapwisha kwiyisha, walambila Shimoni eti, “Bunyakileni bwato pakati, kwambeti muwale tombe twenu mumenshi mwikate inswi.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shimoni walakumbuleti, “Shikwiyisha, kufuma mashiku bulatucele tuliya kwikatapo inswi, pakwinga mulamba njamwe ningwale tombe.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino balawala tombe twabo, nekwikata inswi shingi, tombe twabo twalatatika kupasuka. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino balakuwa banabo balikuba mubwato bumbi kwambeti bese babanyafweko kusabula, naboyo balesa, nomba balesusha mato abili nkayanda kwibila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shimoni Petulo mpwalaboneco walasuntama pantangu pa Yesu nekwambeti, “Kamundekelela Mwami Pakwinga ndeshikwinsa byaipa.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Shimoni ne banendi balenseco pakwinga balakankamana pa kufula kwa inswi isho nshobalekata. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco Jemusi ne Yohane bana bendi Zebediya kayi nebanendi Shimoni, naboyo balakankamana. Lino Yesu walambila Shimoni eti, “Kotatina pakwinga kufuma lelo nube weshikwikata bantu.” <verse number="11" style="v"/>Popelapo balatanta mato ayo kuya kutala kwa mulonga, balashiya byonse nekunkokela Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga shimankuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateyo 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuba mumunshi naumbi walakumana ne muntu wali kukolwa bulwashi bwa mankuntu mubili wonse. Mpwalabona Yesu mulwashi uyu walasuntama kuntangu nekumusengeti, “Mwami ndicishi kwambeti mukute ngofu shakusengula nsenguleni.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu walatandabula likasa lyakendi, walamwikata ne kwambeti, “Ee ndayandanga, koba cena!” Popelapo mankuntu alapwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walamwambileti, “Konyumfwa, kotambila muntu nambi umo makani awa. Nomba obe ululame wenga kuli beshikwiyisha, uyenga ulileshe kuli beshimilumbo kwambeti ulaba cena. Uye ubenge bupe kwelana ne ncalamba Mose kwambeti bantu bashometi ulaba cena.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Necikabeco impuwo ya Yesu yalanyumfwika kubantu bangi. Neco bantu balikwisa kuli endiye kwambeti banyumfwe Maswi akendi kayi nekubasengula malwashi abo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino nendi Yesu walaya kwa enka akupaila.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga mutuloba watontola mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateyo 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba Yesu walikeyisha, popelapo palikuba Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha milawo nabambi. Bantu aba balafuma muminshi yonse ya ku Galileya, ku Yudeya kayi neku Yelusalemu. Ngofu sha Lesa shalikuba muli Yesu kwambeti abasengule. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kufumapo bantu nabambi balaleta mutuloba walikuba watontola mubili nkabali bamunyamuna pa mpasa. Balelesha kwambeti bamwingishe mu ng'andeti bamoneke pantangu pa Yesu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Naboyo balikuyanda kumwingishila pacishinga, lino pakwinga bantu balafula balalilwa kwambeti bamutwale mukati. Neco balatanta nendi pa ciluli ca ng'anda ne kupasula mulyango, balamwingisha ne kumulelesha pampasa yakendi pakati pabantu ne kumushikisha pantangu pa Yesu.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="17 Lowering Man Through the Roof.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="5:19">Bantu bana balangishilinga muntu pa ciluli</figure> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona kushoma kwakendi, “Walambeti, bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiyisha Milawo kayi ne Bafalisi balatatika kwipushaneti, “Nomba uyu niyani lanyashanga Lesa? Niyani welela kulekelela bwipishi sena nte Lesa enka?” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walenshiba ncobalikuyeya mumyoyo yabo neku bepusheti, “Nomba mulayeyelenga cani bintu bya mushoboyo mu myoyo yenu? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nicipeyo capuba kwambila muntu eti, ‘Bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa,’ Nambi kwambeti, ‘Nyamuka, wende’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino ndayandanga kumwambileti mwinshibe kwambeti mwana muntu ukute ngofu shakulekelela bwipishi pacishi ca panshi.” Kufumapo walambila usa watontola mubileti, “Ndakwambilinga, nyamuka, manta mpasa yakobe wenga kucomwenu.” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Popelapo walapunduka bonse kabalanga nemenso abo, walamanta mpasa mpwalikuba wona nekutatika kuya nkalumbaisha Lesa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana kayi balatina. Lino balatatika kulumbaisha Lesa ne kwambeti, “Ici ncotulabono lelo, nkatutana tucibonapo sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakunga Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateyo 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walafuma pansa nekubona weshikusonkesha musonko walikukwiweti Levi, nkali ekala mu ng'anda yamusonko.Yesu walamwambileti, “Nkonkele.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Popelapo neye walanyamuka, nekushiya byonse nekumukonkela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino Levi walabamba byakulya bingi kwambeti basekelele ne Yesu mu ng'anda yakendi. Kwalikuba beshikusonkesha misonko bangi ne bantu nabambi kabalya pamo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bafalisi nabambi ne beshikwiyisha milawo balatatika kudandaulila beshikwiya ba Yesu eti, “Nomba nicani mulalyelenga nekunwa pamo ne beshikusonkesha kayi ne bantu babwipishi?” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Bayumi nkabakute kulangaula mu ng'anga sobwe, nsombi balwashi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ndiya kwishila balulama nsombi babwipishi kwambeti basanduke mu myoyo yabo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wakulikanisha kulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateyo 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bantu nabambi balepusha Yesu eti, “Beshikwiya ba Yohane mubatishi bali kuba necindi cakulikanisha kulya nekupaila, naboyo beshikwiya ba Bafalisi bangi balikwinsa copeleco, bakobe baliya cindi camushoboyo, balo bakute kulya ne kunwowa.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabakumuleti, “Sena balikubwinga ingamubakakatisha kutalya nebanabo, shibwinga kacilipo? Sobwe! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nsombi cindi nicikashike shibwinga mpoti bakamufunyepo pali endibo, Lino ico cindi nibakalikanishe kulya.” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walabambila cikoshanisho eti, “Kuliya muntu welela kukwamuna cimami cacikwisa caina nekutunga pa cakufwala cakeendi. Nkela kwinseco pakwinga naco ngacononga cikwisa kayi cimami nkacela kwendelana pacakufwala ico sobwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kuliya muntu welela kubika waini walino lino munkomwa yacipaya cakendi. Nalabikimo waini walino lino ukute kupasula nkomwa. Waini wonse ngawitika ne konongeka. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nomba waini walino lino welela kubikiwa mucinkuli calino lino. <note caller="-" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkomwa ya cipaya</char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kuliya muntu welela kuyanda kunwa waini walino lino na lanu waini wakaindi pakwinga mukute kwambeti, ‘Usa wakaindi ewaina.’”</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wa makani a Sabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateyo 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi pa Sabata Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balikwenda kabapita mumabala a Maila. Beshikwiya bakendi balatatika kuyapa ngala sha Maila ne kushipikisa mumakasa nkabalya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kufumapo Bafalisi nabambi balepusheti, “Nomba mulenshilinga cani bintu byabula kusuminishiwa pabusuba bwa Sabata?” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Sena muliya kubelengapo calensa Dafeti pacindi mpwalanyumfwa nsala ne banendi? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa nekumanta shinkwa waswepa. Walalya nebanendi shinkwa uyo weshikulyewowa ne beshimilumbo bonka kwelana ne milawo yabo.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Ame nde Mwana Muntu njame ndemwine busuba bwa Sabata.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga wanyana cikasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateyo 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba pa Sabata, Yesu walengila mung'anda yakupaililamo kuya kwiyisha. Mung'anda umo mwalikuba mutuloba watontola likasa lyalulyo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Beshikwiyisha bamilawo ne Bafalisi bali kabalangishisha eti babone, na Yesu ngaumusengula mutuloba usa pabusuba bwa Sabata kwambeti bamucaninepo mulandu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nendi walenshiba ncobalikuyeya. Lino walambila mutuloba usa walikuba watontola likaseti, “kwesa kuno wimane kuntangu.” Neye walanyamuka nekuya kwimana kuntangu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino “Ndamwipushunga, nomba milawo ikute kutusuminisha kwinsa cani pabusuba bwa Sabata? Kwinsa caina ku muntu nambi kumwinshila caipa? Kupulusha buyumi bwa muntu nambi kubononga?” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Apwishe kwambeco walalangishisha bantu bonse balikuba mu Ng'anda yakupaililamo, nendi walambila mutuloba useti, “Tandabula likasa lyakobe.” Neye walatandabula, lino lyalaba cena. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nsombi nabo balakalala nekutatika kulifuyafuya cakumwinsa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasalanga batumwa likumi ne babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateyo 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pacindico Yesu walaya kumulundu kuya kupaila lino bwalaca kapaila. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca walakuwa beshikwiya bakendi. Pakati pabo walasala bali kumi nebabili abo mbalakuweti batumwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Maina abo naya; Shimoni uyo ngwalapa lina lya Petulo, ne Ndileya mukwabo, Jemusi ne Yohane, Filipo ne Batolomeyo, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mateyo, Tomasi, ne Jemusi mwanendi Alufeyo Kai ne Shimoni wa mucipani ca bantu balikulwanina lwanguluko mu cishi ca Islayeli, <verse number="16" style="v"/>ne Yudasi mwanendi Jemusi kayi ne Yuda isikalyoti walesa akumuyaba Yesu kubalwani.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu leyishinga ne kusengula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateyo 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuselela pamulundu pamo ne beshikwiya, walemana pololoka. Palikuba likoto linene lya beshikwiya bakendi kayi ne likoto linene lya bantu lyalafuma kulubasu lwa ku Yudeya neku Yelusalemu. Bambi balafuma muminshi ya Tulo ne Sidoni, ne mumbali mwa Mulonga. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Naboyo balesa akukutika Yesu kayi kwambeti abasenguleko malwashi. Lino bonse balikupenshewa ne mishimu yaipa balacanikako kwambeti abasengule. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balikabayanda kumukumya, pakwinga ngofu shalikufuma muli endiye, shalikubasengula bonse.</para>
  <para style="s">kukondwa ne mapensho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateyo 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesu walalanga beshikwiya bakendi nekubambileti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mwalelekwa amwe mwapenga</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga Bwami bwa Lesa nibwenu!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwalelekewa amwe mulanyumfunga nsala cino cindi,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga nimukekute!</para>
  <para style="q">Mwalelekwa amwe omulalilinga</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga nimukakondwe!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Mwalelekwa omwapatwa ne bantu, kusulwa ne kutukanwa kayi nekumwambeti mwaipa pacebo ca kukonkela ame nde Mwana Muntu! <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kamukondwani cangofu nekushana kayi ne nekusamwa pakwinga cilambo cenu nicinene kwilu. Pakwinga naboyo bashali babo encobalenshila bashinshimi bakulukulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Nsombi mapensho nakabe pali njamwe mobabile</para>
  <para style="q">“pakwinga amwe mwatambula kendi bubile bwenu!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Mapensho nakabe pali njamwe omwekuta cino cindi,</para>
  <para style="q">“Pakwinga nimukafwe nsala!</para>
  <para style="q">Mapensho nakabe pali njamwe omwakondwanga cindi cino,</para>
  <para style="q">pakwinga nimukongumane kayi nimukalile!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mapensho nakabe pali njamwe mwense omukute kwambwa kuba baina kubantu bonse pakwinga nebamashali babo encobali kubenshila copeleco bashinshimi bandemi shibili.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akusuna balwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateyo 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Lino mwense omulakutikinga maswi akame ndamwambilingeti, kamusuna balwani benu kayi nekwinshila byaina abo bamupata. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mubasengelenga kwambeti Lesa abaleleke abo beshikumushinganya kayi nabo beshi kumupensha kayi mubapaililenga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na muntu lakumu kulicili, Pilibuka akume nekumbi nakoyo. Na muntu lakulamunu cakufwala cakobe capelu umuleke amante ne camukati. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na muntu lakusenge cintu umupe. Kai na muntu lamanta cintu cakobe utamwambileti acibweshe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ncomulandanga kwambeti bantu bamwinshile, ne njamwe benshileni copeleco.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Nomba na musuni bantu bonka abo bamusuni, lino ngamulumbwecon? Pakwinga naboyo babwipishi basuni abo babasuni. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Na mulenshinga byaina kulyabo beshi kumwinshila byaina, nomba ngamulumbweconi? Pakwinga naboyo babwipishi encobakute kwinsa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Na mukute kukongolesha abo bonka mbomwashometi nibakamubweshele, nomba ngamulumbaishiweconi? Kai naboyo babwipishi bakute kukongoleshana nemwelo wopelowo! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Amwe mutenseco, kamusunani balwani benu kayi mubenshilenga byaina. Kamutakweletesha kwambeti bakamubweshele. Nimukatambule cipo cenu kwilu. Nimukabe bana ba Lesa wapitapo. Pakwinga neye ukute kwinshila byaina bantu batalumbu ne baipa. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mbuli bameshenu bakwilu ncobakute inkumbo, nenjamwe mube nenkumbo mbuli bameshenu ba kwilu.</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akubeteka bantu bambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateyo 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Mutabetekanga bantu kwambeti nenjamwe Lesa katakamubeteka. Mutapa muntu mulandu kwambeti mutakapewa mulandu ne njamwe, nsombi kamulekelelani, Lesa neye nakamulekelele. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pani banenu pakolola makasa enu, neye Lesa nakamwinshile copeleco, nakamupeni cipimo caina, cashindailwa kayi kacisempukila panshi. Cipimo ncomukute kupiminako banenu neye Lesa nceti akamupimineko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambila cikoshanyo eti, “Sena muntu mpofu ngautangunina mpofu munendi? Sena bonse babili nkabela kuwila mucisengu?” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kuliya weshikwiya welela kupita shikwiyisha wakendi, nomba muntu uliyense ukute kubeti shikwiyisha wakendi nalapwishi kwiya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“Nomba ngobona aconi kapampansha kali mulinso lya munobe nekushiya citondo cili mulinso mwakobe? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Nomba ngawambileconi mukwenu eti, mukwabo, tubone nkufunye kapampansha kali mulinso, na obe mulinso mwakobe omwine kamuli citondo ncolabulunga kubona? Obe mubepeshi tanguna ufunye citondo cili mulinso lya kobe, emposhi ubone cena nekufunya kapampasha kali mulinso lya mukwenu.</para>
  <para style="s">Citondo ne bisepo byakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateyo 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Kuliyawa citondo caina celela kwikata bisepo byaipa, nambi citondo caipa kwikata bisepo byaina. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Anu ekwambeti citondo cili conse cikute kwinshibika nebisepo byakendi. Kuliyawa muntu ukute kuyapa nkuyu kucitondo ca myunga nambi ku binkupu byabitondo. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Muntu uli cena ukute kupulisha byaina bili mumoyo mwakendi, neye muntu waipa ukute kupulisha byaipa bili mumoyo mwakendi pakwinga mulomo ukute kwamba byesula mumoyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Beshikwibaka manda babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateyo 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Nipacebo cini mukute kwambeti, ‘Mwami, Mwami,’ Kakuli nkamukute kwinsa ibyo mbyonkute kwamba? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense lesanga kulinjame nekunyumfwa maswi akame nekwainsa, nindi muleshe ncabele. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ulyeti muntu walebaka ng'anda, uyo walemba kuya panshi akushika palibwe linene, ne kwibaka ng'anda. Mulonga mpowalesula, meshi alatatika kuma kung'anda iyo. Nomba iliyawa kuwa pakwinga walebaka cena. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Nsombi uyo ukute kunyumfwa maswi akame nekutainsa, ulyeti muntu walebaka ng'anda cakubula kwimba panshi. Menshi mpwalesula, alatatika kuma kung'anda. Lino ng'anda yalawa eti nyang'a nyang'a nekonongeka.”</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga musha wa mushilikali mukulene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateyo 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwambila bantu maswi awa, walaya ku Kapelenawo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwalikuba mutangunishi naumbi walikuba mukulene wa bashilikali bakwana mwanda walikuba ne musha ngwali kusuna. Musha uyo wali kakolwa cakwambeti walikuba pepi ne kufwa<figure style="fig" desc="" file="08 Centurion.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="7:2">Mukulene wabashilikali wa Ciloma</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino mpwalanyufwa lulumbi lwa Yesu, walatuma bamakulene nabambi ba Bayuda kuya akumusengeti amushilike musebenshi wa mukulene wa bashilikali. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Abo balatumwa balashika kuli Yesu, balamusenga camakasa abili kwambeti, “Kamubonani uyu muntu mwelela kumunyafwa, <verse number="5" style="v"/>pakwinga usuni mushobo wetu kayi walatwibakila ng'anda yakupaililamo.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walaya nabo. Mpwalashika pepi ne ng'anda, mukulene wa bashilikali walatuma banendi kuli Yesu kuya kumwambileti, “Mwami, mutalishupa, pakwinga ame nkandelela kwambeti amwe mwingile mung'anda yakame. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Weco ndiya kulibikapo kuba walulama kwisa kuli njamwe. Nomba mwambowa maswi musha wakame nabe cena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Pakwinga nenjame nkute kukonkela milawo yabamakulene pancinto kayi nkute bashilikali mbonkute kutangunina. Na ndamwambili mushilikali eti, koya, neye ukute kuya. Na ndamwambili mushilikali eti, Kwesa, neye ukute kwisa, Na ndamwambili musha wakame eti, insa ici, neye ukute kwinsa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfweco, walakankamana. Lino walalanga kubantu bangi abo balikumukonkela ne kwambeti, “Cakubinga ndiya kubonapo lushomo lwamushoboyu pakati paba Isilaeli sobwe!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Balatumwa basa balabwelela kung'anda, nekuya akucana musha uyo laba cena.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapundushunga mwana wa mukalubingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walaya mumunshi umbi ukute kukwiweti Naini. Beshikwiya bakendi nelikoto lya bantu balaya nendi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika pepi ne munshi, walakumanya bantu kabali banyamuna citumbi, ca mutuloba wafwa walikuba emwana enka kuli banyina bamuka lubingi. Bantu bangi ba mumunshi balikuba pamo ne mukalubingi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona mukalubingi uyo walamunyumfwila inkumbo ne kumwambileti, “Kocileka kulila.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walashika kuntangu ne kwikata citumbi ico, Lino balikuba bamanta citumbi ico balemana. Kayi kufumapo walambeti, “Obe mwana mutuloba ndakwambilingeti, punduka!” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mwana mutuloboyo walikuba wafwa walapunduka nekwikala, walatatika kwamba. Lino Yesu walamubwesha kuli banyina. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bonse balatina, popelapo balalumbaisha Lesa kabambeti, “Mushinshimi mukulene labonekele pakati petu, kayi Lesa wesa akupulusha bantu bakendi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kufumapo lulumbi lwa Yesu yalamwaika mucishi conse ca Yudeya kayi ne bishi byonse byalikuba byashunguluka.</para>
  <para style="s">Ntumwi shalatumwa ne Yohane Mubatishi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateyo 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Beshikwiya ba Yohane balamwambila byonse. Lino Yohane walakuwa babili pa beshikwiya bakendi, <verse number="19" style="v"/>ne kubatuma kuli Mwami Yesu kuya kwipusheti, “Sena njamwe ngwalamba Yohane eti lesanga nambi tulangilile naumbi?” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Balatumwa abo mpobalashika kuli Yesu, balamwambileti, “Yohane mubatishi latutumu kwambeti twipushe na njamwe uyo lesanga nambi tulangililenga naumbi?” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pacindico Yesu walikashilika malwashi abantu bangi apusana pusana, bamapensho ne kufunya mishimu yaipa kayi walasengula bampofu bangi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walakumbula beshikwiya ba Yohane eti, “Kamuyani mumwambile Yohane byonse mbyomulabono ne kunyufwa, bampofu balabononga, balema myendo balendenga, beshimankuntu balabanga cena, bashinka matwi balanyufunga, bafu balapundukunga kayi bapenga balanyumfunga Mulumbe Waina. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Walelekwa muntu uyo labulunga kutonshanya pali njame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya bakendi Yohane mpobalaya, Yesu walatatika kwambila bantu bangi balikubapo sha makani a Yohane mubatishi eti, “Mpomwalaya akubona Yohane mucinyika mwalikuyeyeti ulyeti cani? Sena mwalikuyeyeti Yohane uliya ngofu eti litete likute kutenkanowa ne mpepo? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba mwalikuyeyeti Yohane ulyeti cani? Sena nimuntu walikuba wafwala byakufwala byaina? Sobwe bantu beshi kufwala byaina, bakute kusuna malyalya nekwikala mumanda abami. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kamung'ambila, nicani ncomwalaya akubona? Sena mwalikuyeyeti Yohane nimushinshimi? Ee, ndamwambilinga cakubinga kwambeti mwalabona wapita mushinshimi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Pakwinga Yohane ewuyo walambwa mumabala a Lesa, Lesa walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkatume mutumwa wakame kuntangu kwakobe</para>
  <para style="q">kwambeti akakubambile nshila.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Ndamwambilinga kufuma keendi kuliyawa kubapo muntu wapita Yohane, nsombi usa mung'ana mu Bwami bwa Lesa emukulene kupita endiye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantu bonse ne beshikusonkesha misonko balanyumfwa kukambauka kwa Yohane, mpobalabatishiwa balasumina kwambeti Lesa walulama. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nsombi Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha Milawo pakukana kubatishiwa ne Yohane, balakana ncalikuyanda kubenshila Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walapitilisha kwambeti, “Anu bantu ba cino cindi ngandi bakoshanisha ne cani? Anu balyeti cani?” <verse number="32" style="v"/>Balyeti batwanike bekala pabusena bwakulishilapo kabolobeshanyeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Twalamulilishila ngoma,</para>
  <para style="q">amwe muliya kushana!</para>
  <para style="q">‘Twalamwimbila inyimbo sha malila</para>
  <para style="q">amwe muliya kulila!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Pakwinga Yohane mubatishi walesa nkalikanisha kulya kayi nkali kunwapo waini, nomba amwe mwalambeti, ‘Ukute mushimu waipa.’ <verse number="34" style="v"/>Lino Mwana Muntu mpwalesa walatatika kulya ne kunwa, amwe mwalambeti, kamubonani ni weshikulyowa nekukolwa, kayi banendi ni beshimisonko kayi ne babwipishi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nsombi mano a Lesa akute kubonekela kuba ancine ncine kuli bonse bakute kwatambula.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu uli pang'anda ya Shimoni Mufalisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Mufalisi naumbi walakuwa Yesu eti ayenga akulya nendiye. Lino Yesu walaya akwingila mung'anda nekwikala pakulyela. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mu munshi uwu mwalikuba mutukashi wabwikalo bwaipa. Mpwalanyumfweti Yesu lalinga mung'anda ya Mufalisi uyo, walamanta kankuli kesula mafuta anunkila cena. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Walashika nekusuntama kunyuma kwa Yesu, pepi ne myendo kalila<note caller="+" style="f">7:38 <char style="ft" closed="false">Walikuba ekala pakapuna kafupi myendo nkaili yapula kunyuma</char></note>. Walatontosha myendo bya Yesu ne misoshi yakendi ne kutatika kwipukuta ne mishishi yakendi, nekumyanguta bimpanta bya Yessu ne kutatika kumunanika mafuta ayo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino Mufalisi usa walakuwa Yesu mpwalaboneco, walatatika kuyeyeti, “Muntu uyu nabanga mushinshimi wancincine nalenshibi mbuli ncabele mutukashi uyu lamwikatanga pakwinga nkamwisheti nimwipishi.” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walamwambileti, “Shimoni nkute byakukwambila.” Shimoni walakumbuleti, “Beshikwiyisha kamwambani” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Palikuba bantu babili balabweleka mali ku muntu. Umo walabweleka myanda isanu ya mali, naumbi mali makumi asanu. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mpocalashika cindi ca kubwesha, bonse babili balalilwa kubwesha nkongole, lino walabalekelela. Nomba pabantu babili basa, nupeyo shikubwelekesha mali ngweshakasune cikamba?” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shimoni walakumbuleti, “Ame ndayeyengeti uyo walabweleka mali angi,”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu walamwambileti, “Ulakumbulu cena.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lino walalanga kumuntukashi usa ne kumwambila Shimoni eti, “Sena ulabono mutukashi uyu? Mpondashiki mung'anda yakobe uliyawa kumpapo menshi akusamba kumyendo. Nsombi nendi lasambishi myendo yakame nemishoshi yakendi nekwipukuta ne mishishi yakendi. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Obe uliyawa kumyanguta pakumpa mutende, nsombi nendi kufuma mpondeshili mung'anda liya kucilekapo kumyanguta myendo yakame. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Bona mondeshili uliyawa kunanikapo mafuta mumutwi, nsombi uyu lananiki mafuta anunkila cena kubimpanta. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ndakwambilinga cancine ncine, kuyandishisha kunene nkwalandeshe, cilaleshengeti bwipishi bwakendi bwingi bulalekelelwa. Nomba muntu lalekelelwa bwipishi bung'ana ukute kusuna pang'ana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walamwambila mutukashi uyo eti, “Bwipishi bwakobe bulalekelelwa.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lino abo bali kabalya pamo ne Yesu balatatika kwipushanyeti, “Anu niyani muntu uyu weshi kulekelela ne bwipishi?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambila mutukashi uyo eti, “Lushomo lwakobe lulakupulushu, koya mulumuno.”</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Batukashi balashindikila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walendana muminshi, kaya kukambauka Mulumbe Waina wa Bwami bwa Lesa, walikuba ne beshikwiya bali likumi ne babili. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ne batukashi nabamb balafunyiwa mishimu yaipa ne malwashi, Maliya waku Magadala uyo walikukute mishimu yaipa isanu ne ibili <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yowana mukashi wa Kuza uyo walikuba kapitawo wa Helode, Susana, kayi ne nabambi bangi balikunyamfwilisha Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi kusebensesha mali abo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa shikumwaya mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateyo 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balabungana kwalikuba Yesu kufuma muminshi. Lino nendi walabapa mukoshanyo eti, <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Kwalikuba muntu umbi walaya akumwaya imbuto. Lino mpwalikumwaya, shimbi imbuto shalalakila munshila shalalyataulwa, bikeni byalashilya. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shimbi mbuto shalalakila pabulongo bwamabwe. Mposhalamena, misonga yalatatika kuyuma pakwinga kwalabula katonto mubulongo, <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shimbi imbuto shalalakila patufukusa twa myunga, lino tufukusa pakukula twalatatika kushantilila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba shimbi imbuto shalalakila pabulongo bwaina. Shalakula ne kwikata myanda myanda.” Lino Yesu walamba ne liswi lyapelu kwambeti, “uyo ukute matwi, anyumfwe!”</para>
  <para style="s">Ncoilapandululunga mikoshano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateyo 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi balamwipusha pabupandulwishi bwa mukoshanyo uwu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Amwe mwalapewa kwinshiba bintu byasolama bya Bwami bwa Lesa. Nsombi bambi bakute kunyumfwa bambilwa mumikoshanyo ekwambeti, ‘balangishishe, nomba babule kubona’ Kayi ‘Bakutike, nsombi batanyumfwishisha.’”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasansululunga mukoshanyo wa shikumwaya mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateyo 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kupandulula kwa mukoshanyo wa mbuto ni uku, imbuto ni Maswi a Lesa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isho imbuto shalalakila munshila shakoshana ne bantu beshi kunyumfwa Maswi a Lesa, nomba pacindi cing'ana, Satana ukute kwafunya mumyoyo yabo kwambeti babule kushoma ne kupuluka. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isho imbuto shalalakila pabulongo bwa mabwe shakoshana ne bantu abo balanyumfunga Maswi a Lesa ne kwatambula cakusangalala sombi pakwinga baliya miyanda yashimpa bakute kushoma kwa kacindi kang'ana neco na balasunkwa bakute kuwa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Isho imbuto shalalakila pamyunga shakoshana ne bantu beshi kunyumfwa Maswi a Lesa, nomba miyeyo yakuyanda bubile ne byeshikukondwelesha bikute kubakoma, neco nkabekata bisepo byakoma, <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nsombi isho shalalakila mubulongo bwaina, shakosna ne bantu beshi kunyumfwa Maswi a Lesa, ne kwaikata ne kushoma mumyoyo yabo yaina, neco bakute kulimbikila mpaka kwikata bisepo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mumuni wafwekelelwa mu nongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Maliko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Kuliya muntu welela kumunika lampi ne kulifwekelela ne nongo nambi kubika mwinshi lyatebulu. Nsombi ukute ubika pelu kwambeti limunikile abo beti bengile mung'anda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Pakwinga kuliya cintu casolama ceti cikabule kuyubulululwa patuba, kayi cintu ciliconse casolekwa ni cikabonekele patuba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Neco kamucenjelani mbuli ncomukute kunyufwa Maswi a Lesa. Pakwinga uyo ukute kendi nakabikilwepo, nsombi uyo wabula kantu nibakamulamune konse nkakute.”</para>
  <para style="s">Banyina Yesu ne bamakwabo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateyo 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino banyina Yesu ne bamakwabo balashika nkwalikuba, lino baliya kucikonsha kushika pepi nendiye pacebo cakwambeti bantu balikuba bangi. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino muntu naumbi walambila Yesu eti, “Bamanyenu ne bakwenu bemana pansa, balandanga kumubona.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walabambileti, “Bama ne bakwetu niyabo beshi kunyumfwa Maswi a Lesa nekwinsa ncalambanga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalekeshenga lukupwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateyo 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Busuba nabumbi Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi balengila mubwato, Yesu walambeti, “Katutampukilani kutala kwa lwenje kusa.” Popelapo balanyamuka. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino bwato mpobwalikuya, Yesu walona. Kwalesa cilukupwe cinene pamenshi. Bwato bwalatatika kwisula ne menshi kabuyanda pepi nekwibila. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kufumapo beshikwiya balaya kuli Yesu ne kumwambileti, “Mwami, Mwami, kamupundukani tulafu!”</para>
  <para style="p">Lino Yesu walapunduka walakalalila lukupwe ne mankape alamwena tonto <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Nomba lushomo lwenu lulikupeyo?”</para>
  <para style="p">Nabo balatina nekupwilwa mano nkabepushanyeti, “Nomba uyu nimuntu uli econi lambilinga lukupwe nalo lulamunyumfwilinga?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga muntu wekatwa ne mushimu waipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateyo 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maliko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Balo balashika kucishi ca Gelasa calangana ne cishi ca Galileya. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalafuma mubwato walakumanya, mutuloba naumbi walafuma mumunshi. Mutuloba usa walikukute mishimu yaipa. Lingi walikwenda matakosha, nkalikwikala pa ng'anda nsombi mumaceni akumanda. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpwalamubona Yesu, walolobesha ne kufukama kuntangu ne kwamba ne liswi lya pelu eti, “Nomba ndamwinshi cani amwe Yesu mwanendi Lesa wakwilu wapitapo? Ndamusengenga mutampesha.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Walambeco pakwinga Yesu walambila mushimu waipa eti ufumemo muli endiye. Mankanda angi mushimu wamwikata, nambi bantu bamusunga makasa ne ncetani kayi ne nshimbi kumyendo eti bamululamike, wali kasutula. Lino mishimu yaipa yalikumutwala ku cisuwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino Yesu wamwipusheti, “Njobe bani?” Neye walakumbuleti,</para>
  <para style="p">“Njame likoto” Walambeco pakwinga walikukute mishimu yaipa ingi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino popelapo mishimu yaipa iyo yalamupapata Yesu eti ataitandanyina kucisengu citali. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino mwinshi mwa mulundu mwalikuba litanga linene lya nkumba lyali kalilya. lino mishimu yaipa isa yalasenga Yesu eti yenga ingile munkumba isho, neye walaisuminisha. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Lino yalafumamo mumutuloba usa ne kwingila munkumba, Lino litanga lyonse lyalaselemukila kumukolo lubilo kuya kulwenje nekuya kuliwalamo nekufwilamo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Beshikwembela nkumba mpobalaboneco, balaya akwambila bantu balikwikala mumusena kayi ne muminshi calenshika. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Neco bantu balesa akubona calenshika. Mpobalashika kwalikuba Yesu, balacana muntu walafunyiwa mishimu yaipa wekala pepi ne Yesu kaliwafwala, mano kali akwana cena. Lino bantu balatina. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bantu balabona byalenshika balambila bantu mbuli ncalaba cena muntu uyo walikuba ne mishimu yaipa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Lino bantu bonse balikwikala mucishi ca Gelasa balapapatila Yesu eti afumemo mucishi cabo pacebo cakwambeti balatina. Kufumapo walengila mubwato kwambeti abwelele <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino mutuloba uyo walafunyiwa mishimu yaipa walasenga Yesu eti benga bonse, linoYesu walamukanisha ne kumwambileti, <verse number="39" style="v"/>“Bwelela kucomwenu uye wambe bintu byonse Lesa mbyalakwinshili. Popelapo muntu usa walaya mumunshi wonse kaya kwamba sha bintu Yesu mbyalamwinshila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwanendi Yailo ne mutukashi walekata mwinjila wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateyo 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalabwelela kulubasu lumbi lwa lwenje bantu bangi balamutambula, balikuba bakondwa pakwinga bonse bali kaba mupembelela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lino kwalesa muntu wali kukwiweti Yailo uyo wali kutangunina ng'anda yakupaililamo walesa kusuntama kuntangu kwa Yesu ne kumusengeti ayenga kung'anda yakendi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>pakwinga mwanendi mutukashi wa myaka likumi ne ibili mwana umowa, ngwalikukute wali kakolwa cakwambeti ngofwa.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu mpwalikuya, bantu bangi balamushankanya. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Palikuba mutukashi naumbi walikukolwa bulwashi bwa mukunko kwa byaka likumi ne bibili. Walapwisha buboni bwakendi bonse mubang'anga, nsombi kuliya muntu nambi umo walakonsha kumusengula. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Mutukashi uyo walesa kunyuma kwa Yesu pabantu bangi balikuba bamushinguluka nekwikata kucelele kwamunganjo wakendi, popelapo bulwashi bwamukunko bwalapwa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Neco Yesu walepusheti, “Niyani lanjikata ku munganjo?” Bonse bantu balakana eti paliyawa. Petulo walambeti, “Kufula bantu balamukumyunga kayi bantu balamushankanyanga.” <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Nkwali muntu naumbi lanjikata kumunganjo, pakwinga ndanyumfu ngofu shimbi shilafumumo mulinjame.” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino mutukashi usa mpwalaboneti nkela kusolamapo walalitwala kuli Yesu nkatutuma walawa kuntangu kwakendi Yesu. Ne kwamba byonse pamenso a bantu kabanyumfwa mbuli ncalamwikata kumunganjo ne kuba cena pacindi copeleco. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Mwaname, pakwinga washoma njame, koya mulumuno.” <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yesu kacamba kwalesa muntu kufuma ku ng'anda ya mukulene wa ng'anda yakupaililamo ne kumwambila Yailo eti, “Mwanenu lafu kendi, mutapensha beshikwiyisha.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfwa makani ayo walambila Yailo eti, “Utatina, koshoma, mwanobe nabe cena.” <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika kung'anda ya Yailo liya kusuminisha muntu nambi umo eti engilemo, nsombi Petulo, Yohane, ne Jemusi kayi ne baishi nebanyina ba mwana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Bantu bonse mung'anda bali kabalila mwana mutukashi walikuba wafwa. Necikabeco Yesu walabambileti, “Kamucilekani kulila pakwinga uyu mwana nkafwapo, wonowa tulo.” <verse number="53" style="v"/>Popelapo bonse balamuwela, pakwinga bonse balikwi shibeti lafu kendi. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walekata mwana uyo pacikasa nekwambeti, “Mwana obe punduka!” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Popelapo walaba muyumi, walanyamuka. Lino Yesu walabambileti bamupe cakulya mwana alye. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Baishi ne banyina ba mwana uyo balakankamana. Lino Yesu walabambileti kamutaya kwambila muntu uliyense pamakani aya alenshiki.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu latumunga batumwa likumi ne babili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateyo 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walabunganya beshikwiya bakendi ne kubapa ngofu shakufunya mishimu yaipa ne kushilika malwashi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabatuma kuya kukambauka sha Bwami bwakendi Lesa ne kushilika malwashi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walabambileti, “Mutanyamunapo cintu nambi cimo mubulwendo bwenu, mutamanta inkoli, mukopa, cakulya, mali nambi byakufwala bibili. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mwakashika mung'anda moshi bakamutambule cena, mukekale mwepelomo kushikikila busuba mboti mukafume mumushi umo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Uko nkweshi bakabule kumutambula, pakufuma mumushi umo, mukalipampe lusuko kumyendo. Ici nicikabe cishibisho kuli endibo.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balenda muminshi yonse, kabaya akukambauka Mulumbe Waina ne kushilika malwashi kuli konse.</para>
  <para style="s">Helode lapengenga mumoyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateyo 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino mwami Helode, mpwalanyumfwa byonse byalenshika, walapenga mumoyo pakwinga bantu bambi bali kabambeti, “Uyu ni Yohane lapunduku kufuma kubafu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Bambi bali kabambeti, “Ni Eliya laboneke kayi, nabambi eti, ni umo wa bashinshimi bakulukulu lapunduku kubafu.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Helode walambeti, “Yohane ni usa ngondatimbula mutwi, nomba niyani uyu lenshinga bintu ibi mbyondanyumfunga?” Neco wali kayanda kubona Yesu uyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapanga cakulya bantu bali 5,000</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateyo 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohane 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino mpobabwelela batumwa balamwambila Yesu byonse mbyobalensa. Kufumapo Yesu walaya ne beshikwiya bakendi kuminshi yaku Betisaida. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bantu bangi mpobalanyumfwa balamukonkela uko nkwalaya. Yesu walabatambula, neku bambila sha Bwami bwakendi Lesa, ne kushilika abo bali kabasuni kwambeti babe cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lisuba mpolyalikuba pepi kwibila, beshikwiya bakendi bali likumi ne babili balaya kuli Yesu ne kumwambileti, “Kamubambilani bantu benga muminshi ne misena ili pepi balangole byakulya ne kwakona pakwinga kuno nikucisuwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walabambileti, “Amwe mubape byakulya.” Beshikwiya bakumbuleti, “Tukute owa shinkwa usanu ne inswi shibili. Lino sena musuni kwambeti tuye tule byakulya byakwana bantu aba?” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Palikuba batuloba bonka bakwana 5,000.</para>
  <para style="p">Lino Yesu walabambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Kamwambilani bantu bekale mumakoto, likoto lya makumi ali asanu.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balensa mbuli ncobalambilwa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walanyamuna shinkwa usanu ne Iswi shibili uto, walalanga kwilu ne kulumba Lesa, walakomona nekupa beshikwiya eti bayabile bantu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balalya nekwikuta. Nomba beshikwiya balabwesa byonse byalashalako ku bantu nekwisusha bitundu likumi ne bibili.</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo lambangeti Klistu ni Mupulushi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mateyo 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Maliko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba Yesu wali kapaila enka, beshikwiya bakendi naboyo balikuba pepi. Lino walabepusheti, “Sena bantu bangi balambangeti ame njame bani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Balo balakumbuleti, “Bambi balambangeti njamwe Yohane mubatishi. Kayi nabambi balambangeti njamwe Eliya. Kayi nabambi eti njamwe umo wabanshinshimi bakulukulu walapunduka kubafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabepusheti, “Nomba amwe mukute kwambeti ame njame bani?” Petulo walakumbuleti, “Njamwe Wananikwa wa Lesa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uyu ni Mupulushi Walaiwa ne Lesa. uyu ni Yesu Klistu.</char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha lufu ne kupunduka kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateyo 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Maliko 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walakonkomesha beshikwiya kwambeti kabatambila muntu nambi umo makani aya. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “Mwana Muntu welela kupenshewa ne kukanwa ne bamakulene beshimilumbo ne bamakulene baba Yuda ne beshikwiyisha ba Milawo nibakamukane. Nendi naka shinwe, nsombi busuba bwabutatu nakapunduke kubafu.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kufumapo walambila bonseti, “Namuntu layandanga kunkonkela ame, welela kushiya nekusula bintu byonse busuba ne busuba kunyamuna lusanda lwakendi nekunkonkela. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pakwinga layandanga kupulusha buyumi bwakendi nakabutaye. Nomba uyo latayanga buyumi bwakendi pacebo ca njame, cakubinga nakabucane. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nomba cainapo ni cani na muntu laba ne bintu byonse bili mucishi capanshi cino, nendi ubutaya buyumi bwakendi bwancinencine nambi kubononga? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Palico na muntu unyumfwa insoni pacebo ca maswi akame, neye Mwana Muntu nakamunyufwile insoni pakwisa mubulemu bwakendi ne mubulemu bwa Baishi nebwa bangelo bwaswepa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Cakubinga ndamwambilingeti mpobali bambi pano beshi bakabule kufwa kabatana babona Bwami bwa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Ciwa caYesu ncocalasanduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateyo 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Maliko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpopalapita masuba asanu ne atatu Yesu mpwalamba makani aya, walamanta Petulo ne Yohane ne Jemusi walaya pa mulundu kuya kupaila. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino mpwalikupaila, ciwa cakendi Yesu calasanduka ne byakufwala byakendi byalabemba tuu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Popelapo kwalaboneka batuloba babili Mose ne Eliya kabamba ne Yesu. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Balaboneka mubulemu bwa kwilu kayi kabambilana sha palufu lwa Yesu lwakuya kufwila ku Yelusalemu. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino Petulo ne abo mbwalikuba nabo balikuba mutulo. Nomba mpobalapunduka balabona bulemu bwa Yesu ne bantu babili bemana pepi nendiye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Pacindi mpwalikupansana nabo, Petulo walambila Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, cileni kwambeti tuli pano katwibaka mishasha itatu, umbi wenu, umbi wa Mose, umbi wa Eliya.” Petulo nkalikwishiba ncali kwamba. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kacamba, kwalesa likumbi lyabafwekelela. Lino beshikwiya balatina. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino mulikumbi umo mwalanyumfwika liswi lya kwambeti, “Uyu emwaname ndalamusala neco mumunyumfwile!” <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino maswi mpwalacileka kunyufwika, beshikwiya balabona Yesu lashala enka. Neco balamwena tonto, kufuma apo baliya kwambilapo muntu nambi umo mbuli ncobalabona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasengulunga mutuloba walikuba ne mushimu waipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateyo 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Maliko 9:14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mumene mene Yesu ne beshikwiya bakendi batatu balaseluka pa mulundu, nalyo likoto linene lyabantu lyalakumanina ne Yesu. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Popelapo, muntu umbi wamulikoto ilyo walolobesheti, “Bashikwiyisha, ndamusengengeti munyumfwileko inkumbo uyu emwaname enka ngonkute. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ukute mushimu waipa na ulamwikata ukute kakuwa, kayi ne kunyukuma mpaka ufuma lipofu kumulomo. Kayi nkaukute kumulekapo mpaka umulingapo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino ndanga ndasenge beshikwiya benu eti baufunye, nomba balalilwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ha! Bantu babula lushomo, mweshikupindimuna miyeyeyo, nomba ninjikale nenu cindi citali econi? Kamumuletani kuno mwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mwana uyo mpwalikuya kuli Yesu, mushimu waipa walamuwala panshi ne kumunyukumuna. Nendi Yesu walakalalila mushimu waipa ne kushilika mwana usa. Lino walamubwesha kuli baishi. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balakankamana mpobalabona ngofu shinene sha Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga sha lufu lwakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateyo 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Bantu kabacikankamana pa bintu ibyo mbyalensa, Yesu wabambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Kamunyumfwishisha makani aya ngoti ndimwambile! ame Mwana Muntu ninkayabwe mumakasa abantu.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Nsombi balo baliya kwinshiba ncalikwamba pakwinga calikuba casolama nomba baliyawa kwanyumfwishisha. Kayi balatina kumwipusha.</para>
  <para style="s">Niyani mukulene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateyo 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balatatika kupikishana kwambeti benshibe nomba mukulene niyani pakati pabo. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walenshiba ncobali kabayeya mumyoyo, walamanta mwana nekumwikalika kulubasu lwakendi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lino walabambileti, “Muntu uliyense welela kutambula mwana mbuli uyu mulina lyakame, latambulu ame. Muntu uliyense ukute kutambula ame latambulunga uyo walantuma, pakwinga uyo ngomwasula pakati penu emukulene.”</para>
  <para style="s">Labulunga kumutoteka uli kulubasu lwakame</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Maliko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lino Yohane walambeti, “Amwe beshikwiyisha, twabona muntu umbi nkafunya mishimu yaipa mulina lyenu, nomba twamukanisha pakwinga nte wa mulikoto lyetu.” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Mutamukanisha, pakwinga uyo labulunga kutotekeshana nenjamwe uli kulubasu lwenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Munshi wa Samaliya ulakananga kutambula Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lino mpocalashika cindi cakwambeti Yesu enga kwilu, walayeya kuya ku Yelesalemu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Walatuma batumwa kuntangu kwakendi abo balaya kuya kwingila mumunshi wa Samaliya kwambeti bamubambile busena. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Bantu ba mumunshi uyo baliyawa kumutambula pakwinga walikaya ku Yelusalemu. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya ba Yesu, Jemusi ne Yohane, mpobalabona balambeti, “Mwami, sena nkatwela kwambeti tukuwe mulilo ufume kwilu wise wononge bantu aba?” <verse number="55" style="v"/>Yesu walacebuka ne kubakalalila beshikwiya. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Popelapo bonse balanyamuka balaya kumunshi umbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Shakumukonkela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateyo 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Mpobalikuya munshila, muntu umbi walambila Yesu eti, “Nindimukonkelenga kuli konse nkweshi mwenganga.” <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Bamwaba bakute mishima, kayi ne bikeni bikute bisangala, lino Mwana Muntu liyawa pakona.” <verse number="59" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Yesu walambila naumbi eti, “Unkokele.” Nsombi nendi muntu uyo walambeti, “Mwami tanshika munsuminishe njenga mbike bata.” <verse number="60" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Leka bafwa babike bafu banabo, nsombi obe koya ukambauke sha Bwami bwa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Naumbi muntu walambeti, “Nindimukonkele Mwami, lino tanguna nje ndaye kung'anda yakame.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Muntu atatika kulima ne ngombe, kayi nkacebuku kunyuma, Lesa liya nendi incito mu Bwami bwakendi.”</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu walatuma bantu bali makumi asanu ne abili ne bantu babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Panyuma pakendi Mwami Yesu walasala bambi batuloba makumi asanu ne abili ne bantu babili ne kubatuma nanshi kuntangu kuya muminshi ne misena yonse nkwalikuyanda kuyako. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kufumapo walabambileti, “Kutebula kulafulu, lino beshikutebula balacepe. Lino sengani kuli mwine libala kwambeti atume bambi basebenshi beshikutebula.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kamuyani, nomba ndamutumunga mbuli bana bambelele pakati pabaumpe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mutamanta mpotomona ya mali, cola nambi nkwabilo. Mutataya cindi ca kupana mutende ne bantu munshila. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mung'anda muli monse momulengili mutangune kwambeti, Mube lumuno mung'anda muno. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Na mung'anda umo muli muntu layandanga lumuno, lumuno ulo nilukabe kuli endiye. Nsombi na muliya muntu wa mushoboyo, ekwambeti lumuno nilukabwelele kuli njamwe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mwakekala mung'anda yopeleyo kayi mukalye ne kunwa byonse byoti bakamupe pakwinga musebenshi uliwonse ukute kutambula malipilo akendi. Mutafumanga nkomulashikili nekuya kumanda ambi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwashika mumushi mweshi bakamutambule mukalye byonse mbyeti bakamupe. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mukasengule bantu balwashi mumunshi umo kayi nekubambila bantu eti, Bwami bwa Lesa bulesa pepi nenjamwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mwakashika mumunshi umbi bantu bakabule kumutambula, kamuyani munshila sha mumunshi uyo nekwambeti, <verse number="11" style="v"/>nambi lusuko lwamuminshi iyi lulamatila kumyendo yetu nikulupampa nekwambeti lube kamboni. Lino inshibani kwambeti Bwami bwalesa Lesa buli pepi! <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti pabusuba bwakubeteka, minshi iyo nikabe ne mulandu kupita munshi wa Sodomu!</para>
  <para style="s">Minshi yabula lushomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateyo 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Ukute malele, obe Kolasini ne Betisaida! Pakwinga kuli incito yangofu yalenshika muli amwe, ne yalenshika kuminshi ya Tulo ne Sidoni, bantu bakusa, ne balasanduka kendi kuleka bwipishi nekufwala masaka kayi nekulinanika milota, kubonesheti balatembenuku kuleka bwipishi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti pabusuba bwakubeteka Lesa nakamupeni mulandu unene kupita baku Tulo ne Sidoni. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nenjobe Kapelenawo, sena ulayeyengeti nibakakunyamune mpaka kwilu? Sobwe, nibakakuwale panshi pabusena bwa bafu!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti. “Uyo lanyumfwili amwe ekwambeti lanyumfwili ame, uyo weshi kukana ame lakana ne Bata balantuma.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balatumwa balabweleko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bantu bali makumi asanu ne abili ne bantu babili balabwelako kabalibakondwa balambeti, “Mwami, Lino ne mishimu yaipa ilatunyumfwilinga twayambila mulina lyenu.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ndamubona Satana nkalaka kwilu eti kubyasha kwamfula. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino kamunyufwani! Ndamupanga ngofu shakulyata injoka ne tupilili kayi ne kukoma ngofu shonse sha mulwani. Kuliya ceti cikamulinge. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi mutakondwa kwambeti mishimu yaipa yamunyumfwilanga, nomba kondwani pakwinga mena enu alembwa kwilu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakondwanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateyo 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13:16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Pacindico Yesu walakondwa mu Mushimu Uswepa. Lino walambeti, “Ndalumbu Ta, amwe mwine kwilu ne cishi ca panshi pakwinga mulayubululu kubantu babula kwiya bintu mbyomwalasoleka kubantu ba mano ne baiya. Cakubinga Ta, mwalayanda kwinsa kwelana nekuyanda kwenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ba Ta balabika bintu byonse mumakasa akame. Kuliya muntu winshi mwana, nsombi ba Ta bonka. Kayi kuliya muntu winshi ba Ta, nsombi Mwana enka kayi ne abo Mwana mbwalasaleti abayubulwile.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Popelapo walalanga kuli beshikwiya bakendi nekubambila kulubasu eti, “Bakute colwe abo balabononga bintu ibi mbyomulabononga. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndamwambilingeti banshinshimi ne bami bangi bali kuyandishisha kubona mbyomulabononga, nomba baliya kubibonapo. Ni cakubinga bali kuyandishisha kunyumfwa bintu mbyomulayumfunga, nomba baliya kubinyumfwa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa mwine Musamaliya waina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Popelapo kwalesa shikwiyisha Milawo kwambeti asunkwe Yesu ne kumwipusheti, “Amwe beshikwiyisha, nicani ncendela kwinsa kwambeti nkatambule buyumi butapu?” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesu walamwipusheti, “Nomba mu Milawo mwalembwa cani? nomba mukute kubelengamo cani?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shikwiyisha Milawo walakumbuleti, “Suna Mwami Lesa wakobe ne moyo wakobe wonse, ne buyumi bwakobe bonse, nengofu shakobe shonse kayi ne miyeyo yakobe yonse, ‘Kayi kosuna munobe mbuli ncolisuni omwine.’ ” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu wamwambileti, “Ulakumbulu cena, uye winseco, nukabe ne buyumi butapu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leviticus 18 vs 5</char></note>.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino shikwiyisha pakuyanda kulibonesheti walulama, walepusha Yesu eti, “Nomba muname niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Kwalikuba muntu ku Yelusalemu walikuya ku Yeliko. Mpwalikuya munshila, walakumanya kapondo balamwikata, balamufulula ne kumuma, nekumushiya nkali wawisuka. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Lino shimilumbo walikapita munshila yopeleyo, mpwalabona muntu uyo walomwa, walapitila kumbali. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Neye Mulevi walikapita munshila yopeleyo, mpwalashika palikuba muntu walomwa walamubona nomba neye walapitila kumbali. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nsombi Musamaliya walikuba pabulwendo munshila yopeleyo mpwalamubona muntuyo walanyumfwa inkumbo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Walaya mpwalikuba wona waletila mafuta ne waini pabilonda byakendi nekusungapo bikwisa. Mpwalapwisha kwinseco walamumanta pambongolo yakendi ne kumutwala kung'anda ya bensu uko nkwalamubamba cena. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bushiku bwalakonkapo mu Samaliya uyo walapa mali mwine ng'anda ya bensu nekumwambileti, ‘Mumusunge cena, na mukasebensenshe mali naambi ninkese nkalipile ndakabwelanga.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino Yesu pakupwisha walepusha shikwiyisha milawo eti, “Lino mumuyeyo wakobe, niyani pabantu batatu aba welela kuba munendi wamuntu walomwa ne kapondo?” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Shikwiyisha milawo walakumbuleti, “Uyo walamunyumfwila inkumbo.” Lino Yesu walamwambileti, “koya lino winse mbuli copeleco.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lafwakashililinga Malita ne Maliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino Yesu nebeshikwiya bakendi mpobalikuba mulwendo lwabo, balashika mumunshi mwali kwikala Malita. Mutukashi uyo walabatambula ne makasa abili mung'anda yakendi. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Malita walikuba ne mukwabo Maliya uyo walikuba wekala panshi pepi ne Yesu kakutika kwiyisha kwakendi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino pacindico Malita incito yalamufulila walaya kuli Yesu nekwambeti, “Mwami sena nkamubweni kwambeti kanike wakame landekelenga incito yonse? Kamumwambilani ese anyafwe.” <verse number="41" style="v"/>Mwami Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Malita obe! wasukamanga nekupeshewa pa bintu bingi, <verse number="42" style="v"/>nsombi kuli cintu cimo cisuniki, Maliya lasala cintu caina kayi kuliyeti akamulamunepo.”</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu labeyishinga kupaila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateyo 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba Yesu walikapaila kumusena umo. Mpwalapwisha, umo weshikwiya wakendi wamwambileti, “Mwami, kamutwiyishani kupaila mbuli Yohane ncalaisha beshikwiya bakendi.” <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Pakupaila kamwambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ta,</para>
  <para style="q">lilemekwe lina lyenu lyaswepa,</para>
  <para style="q">Bwami bwenu bwise.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mutupenga byakulya bilayandikinga lelo, kayi ne masuba onse.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mutulekelele bwipishi bwetu</para>
  <para style="q">mbuli ncotukute kulekelela bantu beshikutwipishila,</para>
  <para style="q">Kamutatutwala mumasunko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino walabambileti, Nomba na umbi popele pano uya kung'anda yamunendi pakati pamashiku nekwambeti, Mwana, kombwelekako shinkwa utatu, <verse number="6" style="v"/>pakwinga ndapolelwa mwensu uli pabulwendo. Lino ndiya cakumupa kwambeti alye! <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino munobe akumbwila mukati eti, utanshupa! Kucishinga tulacalako kendi kayi ame nebana bakame tulono kendi. Nkandelela kupunduka kwambeti nkupe shinkwa. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ndamwambilingeti, nakapunduke nekumupa, kwakubula kwambeti nimunendi nsombi pakwinga lakakatili kumusenga. Nakamupe byonse mbyabula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Weco ndamwambilinga, kamusengani nimukapewe, kamulangolani nimukacane kayi kamukonkoshani nibakamucalilwe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Pakwinga uyo weshi kusenga ukute kupewa, ne uyo weshi kulangola ukute kucana neye weshi kukonkosha nibakamucalwile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>lino niyani mushali pakati penu, na mwanendi umusenga inswi, sena ngomupa injoka? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambi amusenga liyi, sena ngomupa kapilili? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba amwe, mobantu baipa, mukute kupa bana benu byaina, nomba bata ba kwilu ngabalilweconi kupa Mushimu Uswepa kuli abo balamusengenga?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Belezebulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateyo 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Maliko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walikafunya mushimu waipa walikukanisha muntuyo kwamba. Mushimu uyo mpowalafumamo, muntuyo walatatika kwamba. Neco bantu bonse balikubapo balakankamana. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nsombi bambi balambeti, “Ukute kufunya mishimu yaipa pakwinga Belezebulu emwami wa mishimu yaipa, eukute kumupa ngofu.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Cindi copeleco bambi balelesha kusunka Yesu eti ababoneshe cikankamanisho ceshi cifuma kwilu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walenshiba miyeyo yabo, Lino walabambileti, “Bulelo bonse bwabukilana ne kutatika kulwana, bulelo ubo bukute kumwaika. Na bantu ba mukowa umo babukilana, mukowa uwo ngomwaika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba na bwami bwa Satana bubukilana, nomba bwami ubo ngabuyuma econi? Amwe mulambangeti, nkute kupulisha mishimu yaipa ne ngofu sha Belezebulu. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino na ame ndapulishinga mishimu yaipa mbuli ncobalenshinga beshikwiya benu, nomba ame ngamung'ambeconi eti ndapulishinga mishimu yaipa ne ngofu sha Belezebulu, nomba beshikwiya benu balapulishinga mishimu yaipa nengofu shabani? Palico beshikwiya benu nibakamulesheti mwalubila. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi na ame nkute kupulisha mishimu yaipa mungofu sha Lesa, ekwambeti Bwami bwa Lesa buli pakati penu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Na muntu wangofu kalangilila ng'anda yakendi ne byensho, buboni bwakendi nkabwela kwibwapo. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nsombi umbi wapitapo ngofu na lesa, nekumukoma, ukute kumanta bibya byakendi byonse mbyacinkilamo ne kuyabanya buboni mbwalebila bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Muntu uliyense labulunga kwikatishana nenjame nimulwani wakame, uyo labulunga kunyamfwa kubunganisha mbelele, nendi niweshi kupalanganya.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mushimu waipa ncokute kubwelela mumuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateyo 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Na mushimu waipa ulafumu mumuntu, ukute kuya mumalundu a kuyandaula kwakupumwinina. Nakulabulu kucanika, ukute kwambeti, nimbwelele mung'anda yakame mondalafuma. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino na ulabwelele ukute kucana ng'anda iyo yaswepa cena. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino ukute kuletelapo imbi isanu ne ibili yapitapo pali nayo, kwambeti bengile nekwikala mumuntu uyo. Neco bwikalo bwamuntu uyo bukute kwipa kupita bwakutanguna.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kukondwa kwancine ncine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwambeco mutukashi umbi mulikoto walolobesheti, walelekwa mutukashi walakusema nekukuyamwisha. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walakumbuleti, “bakute colwe abo balanyumfunga Maswi a Lesa ne kwinsa ncalambanga!”</para>
  <para style="s">Bantu balasengenga cingashilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateyo 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantu mpobalikuya kufula, Yesu walatatika kwambeti, “Bantu bacino cindi baipa, bakute kuyanda kubona cingashilo cishikufuma kwilu, lino nteshibakacibonepo cingashilo ico, nsombi ca mushinshimi Yona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mbuli Yona ncalikuba cingashilo ku Ninive, neye Mwana Muntu nakabe cingashilo capewa kubantu ba cino cindi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwakubeteka mwami mutukashi wa kumbonshi kwa cishi ca Sheba nakamutoteke pakwinga walafuma kwakuma cishi kwisa akunyumfwa mano a Solomoni. Kamubonani pano mpwali wapita Solomoni <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pabusuba bwakubetekwa, bantu baku Ninive nibakapunduke pamo ne bantu bamusemano uwu, nibakabatoteke. Pakwinga balo balasanduka kufuma kubwipishi, mpwalabakambaukila Yona. Lino mpwali pano wapita Yona.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mumuni wa mubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateyo 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6:22-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Kuliya muntu wela kumunika lampi ne kwisoleka nambi kwifwekelela ne nongo, nsombi ukute kwibika pelu kwambeti imunikile bonse balengilinga mung'anda. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Menso enu emumuni wa mubili wenu. Na menso enu ali cena. Ne mubili wonse ukute kuba mu mumuni. Nsombi na menso enu abula kuba cena, mubili wonse ukute kuba mumunshinshe. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino kamucenjelani kwambeti mumuni uli muli njamwe utaba mushinshe. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Neco na mubili wonse kauli mumuni kwakubula mushinshe, mubili wonse ukutekuba mumuni mbuli lampi lilakumunikilinga.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lakalalilinga Bafalisi ne Beshikwiyisha Milawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwamba, Mufalisi walamukuwa eti alye nendiye. Neco Yesu walaya mung'anda nekwikala kwambeti kulya. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mufalisi uyo walakankamana mpwalaboneti Yesu latatiki kulya katana asamba kumakasa kwelena ne myambo yabo. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Popelapo Mwami Yesu walamwambileti, “Lino amwe Bafalisi mukute kusuka kunsa kwambale nenkomeshi, nsombi mumyoyo yenu mwesula kulisuna ne nebukapondo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Amwe mobantu baluya! Sena Lesa walalenga byakunsa ntendiye walalenga ne byamukati? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Pakupa bapenga, mubapenga bintu ibyo bili mukati munkomeshi ne mumbale, Lino byonse bintu byenu nibikabe byaswepa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Mapensho, kuli amwe Bafalisi! Pakwinga mulabikilinga mano kwambeti mupe Lesa ca likumi pa tuntu tungana tungangana tweshikulengesha kwambeti buchisa bununkile cena. Nsombi nkamukute kwinshila bantu bintu byalulama nambi kusuna Lesa. Pakwinga bintu ibi mwelela kubinsa, kwakubula kusula nabimbi ibyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Mapensho nakabe pali njamwe Bafalisi! Pakwinga mukute kusala bipuna byabulemu mumanda akupaililamo, ne kusuna kupewa mitende yabulemu mumisena yakulishilamo.” <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Mapensho nakabe pali njamwe bafalisi, pakwinga mulyeti manda ataboneke ngobakute kulyatapo cakubula kwinshiba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lino shikwiyisha Milawo umbi walakumbuleti, “Amwe mobeshikwiyisha pakwambeco nenjafwe mulatusampulunga.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti mapensho kuli abo beshikwiyisha Milawo pakwinga mukute kupa bantu mikuli yalema, nsombi amwe mobene nkamukumyuko nambi pang'ana. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mapensho nakbe pali njamwe, pakwinga mukute kwibaka byumbwe byaina byabashinshimi, kakuli bamashali benu ebalashina bashinshimi. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lino ekwambeti ico calensa bamashali benu cilaleshengeti mukute kucisuminisha kwambeti balo balashina bashinshimi amwe mwalebaka byumbwe. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Weco Lesa mu mano akendi walambeti, ninkabatume bashinshimi ne batumwa, Lino nabambi pakati pabo nibakabashine kayi nabambi nibakabapenshewe. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nomba bantu bacino cindi nibakapewe mulandu wa bashinshimi bonse balashinwa kufuma kumatatikilo a cishi capanshi, <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kutatikila kukushinwa kwa Abelo kushikila kukushinwa kwa Sakaliya, uyo walashinwa pakati pa cipaililo kayi ne Musena Uswepa wa Ng'anda yakendi Lesa. Ndamwambilingeti bantu ba musemano uwu nibakapewe mulandu palibi byonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>“Malele kuli abo beshikwiyisha milawo! Mwalamanta maki akucalwila bantu bamano. Amwe mobene muliya kwingila, mwalakanisha abo balikuyanda kwingila.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalafuma mung'anda umo, beshikwiyisha Milawo kayi ne Bafalisi balatatika kumutongokila ne kumwipusha mipusho ingi yapusana pusana. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Balikuyanda kumucaninapo mulandu mumyambo yakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lacenjeshenga bandemishibili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-27">Mateyo 10:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacindico bantu mpobalabungana kwalikuba Yesu, bantu balatatika kulyatana cebo cakufula, Yesu walatanguna kwambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Kamucenjelani kamutabeti cishikufufumisha shinkwa ca Bafalisi, pakwinga nkabenshi ncobakute kwamba. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kantu kalikonse kafwekewa nikakafwekulwe nambi kasolama nikakenshibikwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neco bilibyonse mbyomulamba mumushinshe nibikanyufwike patuba pa bonse, mbyomulabelebeshana ne muntu mucipinda nibikambwe pamenso a bantu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Welela kutinwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateyo 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Ndamwambilinga mobanse mutatina abo beshikushina mubili, nomba kuliya nacimbi ncobela kwinsapo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino ndamwambilingeti ngomwelela kutina ni Lesa uyo ukute kushina buyumi bwa muntu, kayi ukute ngofu shakumuwalani mumulilo utapu, mumutinenga Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Sena Tutite tusanu ntebakute kulishiwa ne tumali tung'ana twa mangwe? Lino kuliya nambi umo Lesa ngwakute kulubapo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba mishishi yenu ili mumutwi mwenu yonse waibelenga. Neco mutatinanga pakwinga amwe mwadula kupita baciba bangi.</para>
  <para style="s">Shakusumina Yesu pamenso abantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Mateyo 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ndamwambilinga cakubinga, muntu uliyense lansumininga pamenso abantu, nenjame nde Mwana Muntu ninkamusumine pamenso a bangelo ba Lesa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nsombi Muntu uliyense lankananga pamenso a bantu, nenjame nde Mwana Muntu ninkamukane pamenso a bangelo ba Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Muntu uliyense weshi kwamba maswi aipa pa Mwana Muntu inga ulekelelwa, nsombi muntu uliyense weshikusampula Mushimu Uswepa, nteshi akalekelelwepo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Bakamwikata kwambeti bakamubeteke mung'anda yakupaililamo, kuli beshikwendelesha nambi kubaleli, mutakasukameti, nimukumbuleconi, nekukaba kuyeyeti nomba nituye twambe cani? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mushimu Uswepa nakamwishibishe ncomwelela kwamba pacindico.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa muntu mubile muluya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Umbi muntu walikuba mulikoto walambila Yesu eti, “Beshikwiyisha, kamumwambila mukwetu ampeko buboni bwalashiya bata balobe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu wamukumbuleti, “Obe nomba niyani walampa incito yakumubeteka amwe nambi kuyabanya bintu byalamushila bameshenu balobe?” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walapitilisha kubambila bantu, “Kamucenjelani kayi mutaba bantu basunishi buboni. Pakwinga buyumi bwa muntu nkabwela kupimwa ne buboni mbwakute.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabambila mukoshanyo eti, “Umbi muntu mubile walikukute libala umo mwalekata byakulya bingi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mpwalaboneco walatatika kuyeya mumoyo eti, ‘Ndiya butala bunene mwakubika byakulya byakame byonse ibi ninjinseconi’ <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lino walambeti, ‘Nimwaye matala akame nekwibaka ambi anene kwambeti mbikemo byakulya ne buboni bwakame bumbi bonse. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lino ninkambile moyo wakameti, ukute buboni bwingi bwakwana byaka bingi. Neco pumwina, kolya ne kunwa nekukondwa.’ <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi Lesa walamwambileti, ‘Omuluya! Lelo lyopele mashiku nufwe. Nomba bintu byonse ibi mbyowalabamba kushikila cino cindi nibibe byabani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino Yesu pakupwisha walambeti, “Encoti cikabe kuli abo beshikulibunjikila buboni, kakuli pamenso a Lesa baliyapo buboni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kamubani bantu babula kulibilika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateyo 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Pacebo ici ndamwambilingeti mutalisukama pa buyumi bwenu eti nitulye cani nambi nitufwale cani. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pakwinga buyumi bwapita byakulya, ne mubili wapita byakufwala. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kamubonani bikwangala, nkabishanga, nkabitebulu biliya ng'anda yakusungilamo bintu nambi manga. Nsombi Lesa ukute kubisanina. Sena nkamwinshi kwambeti Lesa umusuni kupita bikeni? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Niyani palyamwe welakunungilako busuba bumo kubuyumi bwakendi? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nomba na nkamwela kucikonsha kwinsa kantu kang'ana eti ako, nipacebo cini mulasukamanga pa bintu bimbi ibyo? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kamubonani maluba ncakute kukula. Nkakute kusebensa nambi kutunga byakufwala, nsombi ndamwambilingeti nambi Mwami Solomoni mububile bwakendi bonse, liya kubapo ne byakufwala byaina byalaboneka eti limo pa malubayo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino na ni Lesa ukute kufwalika mwila uyo ukute kwinsa lelo mpouli, lilo bauwala pa mulilo, nomba amwe, nkela kumufwalika? Amwe bantu balushomo lung'ana!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Weco mutasukamanga nambi kuyeyeti nimulye cani nambi kunwa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ibi bintu, bantu bakunsa bakute kubiyandaula, nsombi Bameshenu bacinshi kwambeti byonse mubisuni. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Neco kamuyandaulani Bwami bwa Lesa, nakamupeni bintu byonse ibyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha Bubile bwa kwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateyo 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Amwe kalikoto kang'ana kambelele shakame, mutatina pakwinga Bameshenu balayanda kumupa Bwami. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kamulishani buboni mbomukute, mali mupe bapenga. Kamulilangwela mpotomona shitabolo kayi mubike buboni bwenu kwilu nkweti bukabule kubola, pakwinga kuliya kabwalala wela kushikako, ne muswa nkawela kubononga. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Pakwinga myoyo yenu ikutekuba kuli bubile bwenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Basebenshi balibambila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Kamubani balibambila cindi conse kayi malampi enu abenga abangila lyonse. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kamubani eti basebenshi balapembelenga mwami wabo lafumunga kubwinga kwambeti mpoti ashikile ne kukonkosha, nabo bamucalwile bwangu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bakute colwe basebenshi beshi bakacanike kabalanga ne menso mwami wabo akabwela. Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti mwami wabo nakafwale byakufwala bya ncito nekubekalika nekubapa byakulya. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Bakute colwe basebenshi mwami mboti akacane balibambila, nambi akese pakati pamashiku nambi kumaca. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nsombi kamwanukangeti, mwine ng'anda abangawenshiba cindi kabwalala ncalesanga, inga nkela kuleka kabwalala kwingila mung'anda yakendi. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nenjamwe copeleco, kamubani mwalibambila kumutambula Mwana Muntu pakwinga lakesanga pacindi ncomwabula kwingashila.”</para>
  <para style="s">Musebenshi walushomo ne wabula lushomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateyo 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Neye Petulo walepusheti, “Mwami, sena mukoshanyo uyu mulambilinga afwe twenka nambi bantu bonse?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Mwami Yesu walakumbuleti, nomba niyani musebenshi ukute lushomo kayi ne mano? Uyo mwami ngoshi akape incito yakulangilila bonse ba mu ng'anda yakendi nekupa banendi byakulya pacindi celela? <verse number="43" style="v"/>Nakatambule cilambo musebenshi uyo mwami wakendi pakubwelela ngweti akacane nkensa ico. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti mwami wakendi nakamupe incito yakubona bintu byonse mbyakute.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lino na musebeshi uyo lamba mumoyo wakendi eti, mwami wakame lacelwa kwisa, lino utatika kuma basebenshi banendi batuloba ne batukashi kayi ne kutatika kulya, kunwa ne kukolwa. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Mwami wa musebeshi uyo lakesanga pabusuba mbwateshi kayi nepa cindi ncabula kwingashila. Nakamupe cisubulo ciyosha ne kumuwala uko nkoti kukabenga bantu babula lushomo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Musebenshi uyo wishi mwami wakendi ncasuni, nomba liya kulibambila nambi kwinsa ncasuni mwami wakendi nakamukwipe cangofu. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nomba musebenshi utacinshi ncasuni mwami wakendi, na lepishi mwakubula kwinshiba nakomwe pang'ana. Muntu uliyense walapewa bingi welela kubwesha bingi. Muntu walapewa bingi kwambeti asunge, nakambilwe kubwesha bingi pelu pa ibyo mbyalapewa.</para>
  <para style="s">Sha kupansana kwa bantu pacebo ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateyo 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>“Ndalesa kuwala mulilo mucishi capanshi, nendakondwa kwambeti mulilo newabangila kendi! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Nomba ndelela kwingila mulubatisho lwamapensho anene, neco moyo wakame nkawekalikana kushikila mapensho ayo akenshike. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Sena mulayeyengeti ndalaleta lumuno mucishi ca panshi? Cakubinga ndiyawa, nsombi ndalaleta kupansana. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Kufuma lelo mumukowa umo nimukabe bantu basanu bapatana, batatu nibakapatane nebabili. Naboyo babili nibakabukilane ne batatu <verse number="53" style="v"/>Baishi nibakabukile mwana mutuloba, neye mwana mutuloba nakabukile baishi, banyina nibakabukile mwana mutukashi, neye mwana mutukashi nakabukile banyina. Kumakwendi batukashi nibakabukile mulekashi, neye mulekashi nakabukile kumakwendi batukashi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Paliya ucishi cindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mateyo 16:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yesu walambila bantu bonseti, “Na mulabono likumbi kalifumina kumboshi, mukute kwambeti, imfula niloke lelo, nicakubinga ikute kuloka. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Na impepo itatika kupupula kufumina kumusansa mukute kwambeti lelo nikupye cepa, kayi kukute kuba copeleco. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Amwe bantu batenshi mbyomulambanga, mukute kwinshiba kuboneka kwa cishi capanshi ne kwilu, nomba nicani nkamukute kwinshiba bupandulushi bwa bintu bilenshikinga masuba ano?”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha kwikatana ne munobe wa mulandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25-26">Mateyo 5:25-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>“Nomba nipacebo cini nkamukute kwinsa byalulama mobene? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Na mulenga kunkuta ne munobe wa mulandu,wela kufwambana kunyumfwana nendi kamucili panshila, kwambeti katakutwala kuli weshi kubeteka. Pakwinga neye weshikubeteka inga ukutwala kumushilikali, neye mushilikali inga ukusunga mujele. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Ndakwambilinga cakubingeti nteshi ukafumemo kushikila ukalipile byonse bilayandikinga.”</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Musanduke kubwipishi bwenu nambi mufwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Pacindico bantu bambi balikubapo balamwambila Yesu makani a bantu baku Galileya abo Pilato mbwalashina mung'anda ya Lesa nekusankanya milopa yabo pamilumbo njobalikubenga kuli Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Sena mulayeyengeti abo ba Galileya balashininwa balikuba baipa kupita ba Galileya bambi bonse? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Sobwe! Lino ndamwambilingeti na mubule kusanduka kubwipishi bwenu nenjamwe nimukafweti basa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba abo bantu likumi nebasanu ne batatu lwalabawila lubumbu lutali lwa ku Siloamu, mulayeyengeti balikuba baipa kupita bantu bonse balikwikala mu Yelusalemu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sobwe! Nsombi namubule kusanduka kubwipishi bwenu nenjamwe nimukafwe eti basa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa citondo ca mukuyu citekata bisepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walabambila mukoshanyo uwu, “Kwalikuba muntu naumbi walikukute citondo ca mukuyu calikuba mulibala lya minyansa. Bumbi busuba walaya kucitondo kuya kubonako nkuyu, nsombi liya kushicanako. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino walambila musebenshi eti, ‘Bona nibyaka bitatu nkanjisa kuno kuyanda nkuyu kumukuyu uyu, nsombi nkankute kucanapo. Lino citeme cilonongelenga cani bulongo’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba nendi walakumbuleti, ‘Mwami ulekeni kwacaka cino conka. Nindubambilile cena nekubika mboleshi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpani nicikekate bisepo mwakali. Nsombi na cikabule kwikata mukaciteme.’”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashilikinga mutukashi mulema musana pa busuba bwa Sabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino pabusuba bumbi bwa Sabata, Yesu walikwiyisha mung'anda yakupaililamo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mung'anda umo mwalikuba mutukashi walikuba ne mishimu yaipa walapenga kwa byaka likumi ne bisanu ne bitatu. Walikwenda kali wakotama, nkalikucikosha kololoka nambi pang'ana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalabona mutukashi uyo walamwambileti, “Mutukashi, ulasungululwa kubulwashi bwakobe.” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabika makasa akendi pali endiye, popelapo walololoka nekutatika kulumbaisha Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino mukulene wa ng'anda ya kupaililamo walakalala cepa mpwalaboneti Yesu lashiliki muntu pa busuba bwa Sabata. Lino walambila bantu eti, “Kuli masuba asanu ne bumo ngotwelela kusebensa mbuli ncocalembwa mumilawo. Neco mwisenga kushilikwa mumasubayo, kufunyakowa pa busuba bwa Sabata Sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino Mwami Yesu walamukumbuleti, “Amwe mobantu omukute kwamba mbyomutenshi, niyani mulikoto wela kubula kucalwila musune nambi mbongolo yakendi ne kuya kwinwisha menshi pa busuba bwa Sabata? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba uyo mutukashi mwana wa mumukowa wa Abulahamu uyo Satana ngwalasunga kwa byaka likumi ne bisanu ne bitatu, sena nkelela kusungululwa pa busuba bwa Sabata?” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalambeco balwani bakendi balanyumfwa nsoni, nsombi bantu bonse balasangalala pabintu byonse byaina bikankamanisha mbyalensa.</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa mbuto ya masitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateyo 13:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesu walepusheti, “Anu bwami bwa Lesa bulyeti cani? Nomba ngandibukoshanisha necani? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Bwakoshana ne luseke lwa mastadi ulo muntu ndwalabyala mulibala mwakendi. Mpolwalamena nekukula, calaba citondo cinene kayi ne bikeni byalabambilamo bisangala mumisampi yaco.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshanyo wa cishikufufumisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateyo 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kayi Yesu walepusheti, “Anu Bwami bwa Lesa ngandibukoshanisha necani? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bulyeti cikufufumusha shinkwa, ico mutukashi ncalasankanya ne bunga wakwana bikopo bitatu, kushikila byonse byalafutumuka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Cishinga cing'ana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mateyo 7:13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu mpalikuba pabulwendo bwakuya ku Yelusalemu, walenda muminshi kaya kwiyisha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino umbi muntu walepusha Yesu eti, “Mwami, sena ni bang'ana beti bakapuluke?” Yesu walakumbuleti, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kamweleshani cangofu kwingila pacishinga cing'ana pakwinga ndamwambilingeti bantu bangi nibakeleshe kwingila, nsombi nteshi bakacikoshe. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino mwine ng'anda nakanyamuke nekucala kucishinga. Lino amwe mwemana pansa nimukatatike kukonkosha ne kwambeti, ‘Kamutucalwilako.’ Nsombi nendi nakamukumbuleti, ‘Kandimwinshi nkomulafumini.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Lino nimukatatike kwambeti, ‘Pasa twalikulya ne kunwa pamo nenjamwe kayi mwalikwiyisha muminshi yetu.’ <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nsombi nakamwambileti kandimwinshi nkomulafumininga, fumani apa mwense babwipishi. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino nimukalile nekukokota meno, nimukabone Abulahamu ne Isaki ne Yakobo kayi ne bashinshimi bonse kabali mu Bwami bwa Lesa, nsombi amwe kamuli pansa. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Bantu nibakafume kucwe ne kumboshi ne kumusansa ne kunyika, kwisa kwikala nekulya mu Bwami bwa Lesa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Lino abo balikunyuma nibakabe kuntangu naboyo balikuntangu nibakabe kunyuma.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalililinga Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateyo 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pacindi ico Bafalisi bambi balesa kuli Yesu nekumwambileti, “Kamufumani kuno, mwenga kumusena umbi pakwinga Helode layandanga kumushina.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walakumbuleti, “Kamuyani mumwambile uyo mwaba eti, ‘Ndafunyunga mishimu yaipa ne kushilika bantu lelo ne lilo. Lino pabusuba bwa butatu ninkapwishe incito yakame.’ <verse number="33" style="v"/>Necikabeco ndelela kuba pa bulwendo lelo, ne lilo kayi ne busuba bwakonkapo, pakwinga nkacainapo mushinshimi kushinwa kumbi, nsombi ku Yelusalemu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Obe Yelusalemu, Yelusalemu, weshikushina bashinshimi nekupwaya mabwe bantu abo Lesa mbwalatuma kuli njobe. Lingi ndalikuyanda kubunganya bantu mbuli ncoikute kwinsa inkuku pakufukatila twana twayo mumapapamino, nsombi obe walakana.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Neco ng'anda ya Lesa inene iyi nikabe matongo. Ndamwambilingeti nteshi mukambonepo kayi kushikila mukambeti, “Walelekwa uyo lesanga mulina lya Mwami Lesa.”</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashilikinga mutuloba mulwashi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba bwa Sabata Yesu walakwiwa kuya kulya kung'anda ya mukulene wa Bafalisi. Popelapo Bafalisi bali kabamulangishisha. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino pantangu pakendi Yesu palikuba muntu walikuba washimba mubili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walepusha Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha Milawo eti, “Sena Milawo ikute kusuminisha kushilika muntu pa busuba bwa Sabata nambi ne?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nsombi balo balamwenowa. Lino Yesu walamanta muntu uyo, wamushilika nekumwambileti koya. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Popelapo Yesu walabepusheti, “Nomba nibani pakati penu. Na ng'ombe iwila mumukalo pa busuba bwa Sabata, sena nkela kwisabula pa cindico?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino balalilwa kumukumbula.</para>
  <para style="s">Kulicepesha ne kutambula cena bensu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona bantu balakwiwa kulya nendi balatatika kulisalila bipuna byabulemu, walabambila mukoshanisho eti, <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Na muntu umukuwa kubwinga, mutekalanga pacipuna ca bulemu, pakwinga uyo muntu lamukuwu inga kakute bambi bapita amwe ba bulemu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco uyo walamukuwa mwense mobabili nakese akamwambileti, kamufumani apa, pani cipuna ici kumuntu uyu, Lino nimukanyumfwe insoni mwakanyamuka kuya kwikala pa cipuma cabula bulemu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nomba na bamukuwa, kamuyani mwikale pabusena bwabula kuba bwabulemu kwambeti uyo mwine lamukuwu akamwambileti, ‘Kamwisani mwikalile pano, pa cipuna ca bulemu.’ Ici nicikakupe bulemu pamenso abantu bonse mbowalakwiwa nabo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu uliyense weshikulisumpula nakacepeshewe nsombi muntu weshikulicepesha nakasumpulwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambila Mufalisi walabakuweti, “Na mulakuwu bantu kwisakulya nabo cakulya ca munshi nambi ca mansailo, mutakuwa banenu, bakamukowa, ne bamakwenu nambi banobe babile, pakwinga naboyo nga bamukuwani, neco ngamutambulila limo cipo cenu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nsombi na ulabamba byakulya byakusekelela, kuwa bakandu ne balema kayi ne bampofu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino nukapewe colwe, pakwinga balo nkabela kucikonsha kumubweshela. Lesa nakamubweshele pabusuba ubo baswepa bakapunduka kubafu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wamalyalya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateyo 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Muntu umbi palyabo Yesu mbwalikulyanabo, mpwalanyumfwa makani aya, walambila Yesu eti, “Walelekwa uyo eti akalye nabo pakusekelela mu Bwami bwa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nendi Yesu walakumbuleti, “Kwalikuba muntu umbi walabamba malyalya kwambeti basekelele, ne kukuwa bantu bangi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Cindi camalyalya mpocalashika walatuma musebenshi wakendi kuya kubakuwa nekubambileti, kamwisani bintu byonse bilabambiwa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nsombi bonse balakwiwa balatalika kwamba bintu byalabatatisha. Mutanshi walambeti, ndaulu libala neco ndelela kuya kulibona. Bandekeleleko nteti njise.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Umbi walambeti, Ndaulu ng'ombe shakwana bipani bisanu, ndenga akushelesha, mundekeleleko nteti njise. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Naumbi walambeti, Ame ndeba mutukashi lino lino neco nteshi njise.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Lino musebenshi walabwelela ne kumwambila mwami wakendi byonse ibyo. Mwine ng'anda walakalala, lino walamwambila musebesheti, endesha, koya munshila shinene ne shing'ana sha mumushi ukuwe bakandu ne balema kayi ne bampofu wise nabo kuno. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mpwalabwela musebenshi walambeti, mwami, ndenshi kwelena nencomulang'ambili, kayi busena mobucili. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino mwami wakendi walakumbuleti, koya munshila ne mumikondo ya muminshi ubambile bantu cangofu eti bese kwambeti ng'anda yakame isule. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndamwambilingeti paliya nambi umo palyabo mbondalakuwa weshi alyeko malyalya akusekelela kwakame!”</para>
  <para style="s">Makatasho akuba shikwiya wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mateyo 10:37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Likoto linene lya bantu lyalakonkela Yesu, lino walapindamuka ne kubambileti, <verse number="26" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense layandanga kuba weshikwiya wakame welela kusuna ame kupita baishi ne banyina, nambi bakashendi ne bana, banse batukashi ne batuloba, kupita buyumi bwakendi. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense labulunga kulikana mwine ne kuba walimbambila kupenshewa, nkela kuba shikwiya wakame.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Nomba niyani umo pali amwe ayandanga kwibaka ng'anda itali, sena nkakute kwikala panshi nekubona na ukute mali akwana bintu bikute kuyandika kwambeti apwishe ng'anda iyo? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakwinga nalabulu kwinseco, ngacikonshyowa kubamba panshi, nekwalilwa kupwisha. Nomba bantu beshikubona ibi inga bamuseka. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nibakambeti, uyu muntu walatatika kwibaka ng'anda, nomba lalilwa kupwisha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Nomba nimwami cini, wela pakuya kulwana ne mwami umbi, nkakute kwikala panshi nekuyeya cena? Ukute kuyeya kwambeti nibashilikali byulu makumi abili bela kulwana ne mwami usa umbi, uyo lesanga bela kucikonshya ni bashilikali byulu likumi limo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Neco na labono kwambeti nkela kucikonshya, ukute kutuma beshikumwimanina kwambeti be ngabasenge lumuno, mwami usa kacili kutali.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Weco muntu uliyense labulunga kushiya bintu byonse mbyakute, nkela kuba weshikwiya wakame.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mucele wasambuluka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateyo 5:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Mucele waina nomba na ulasambuluku ngamwinseconi kwambeti ube cena kayi? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Uliyawa incito kubulongo nambi pa bufumba bwakubika mulibala bakute kutayowa. muntu ukute matwi anyumfwe!”</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa mbelele yataika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateyo 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino beshikusonkesha musonko ne bantu nabambi balikubula kukonka Milawo, balesa kwambeti banyumfwe mulumbe wa Yesu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino Bafalisi ne beshikwiyisha ba Milawo balatatika kudandaula ne kwambeti, “Uyu muntu latambulungeconi bantu babwipishi, nekulya nabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambila mukoshanyo eti,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Na umbi pali amwe kakute mbelele shili mwanda, lino imo itaika sena nkela kushiya mbelele shili makumi asanu ne ana ne shisanu ne shina ne kuya kulangaula kushikila wicana? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino na layicana ukute kukondwa ne kwinyamuna pamafushi <verse number="6" style="v"/>nekwitwala kung'anda. Lino ukute kukuwa banendi ne beshikamukowa nekubambileti, katukondwani pamo pakwinga mbelele yakame yanga yataika ndaicana, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ndamwambilingeti, nakoyo kwilu nikukabe kukondwa pamuntu umo wabwipishi lasanduku kubwipishi, kupita bantu bali makumi asanu ne ana ne basanu ne bana balulama batasuni kusanduka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa lyali lyataika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Na mutukashi umbi nkakute mali amasilifa likumi, na imo itaika ngawinseconi? Sena nte ukute kumunika lampi nekupyanga mung'anda yakendi nekulangaula cena monse kushikila wicana? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Alicana ukute kukuwa banendi ne beshikamukowa nekubambileti, ‘Katukondwani pamo pakwinga lyali lyakame lyanga lyataika ndalicana.’” <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Ndamwambilinga ne kwilu encobakute kwinsa bangelo ba Lesa bakute kukondwa na muntu umo weshi kwinsa bwipishi lasanduku mubyaipa.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa mwana wataika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu kayi walabambileti, “Kwalikuba mutuloba naumbi walikukute bana batuloba babili. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino kanike bantu walabambila baisheti, ‘Ta, kamumpani buboni mbomwela kunjabilako ame mumpele limo.’ Nabo bameshabo balabayabanya buboni bwabo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kapatana papita masuba angi, kanike bantu uyo walolisha buboni bwakendi nekumanta mali kuya pabulwendo kucishi ca kutali uko nkwalaya akononga mali akendi onse mubwikalo bwaipa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpwalapwisha mali akendi onse, mucishi umo mwalaba nsala inene, lino walatatika kupenga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino walaya kumuntu naumbi wa mucishi umo. Lino muntu uyo walamupa incito yakwembela ne kusanina nkumba. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mutuloba uyo walatatika kukumbwa bufufu bwamusekese mboshali kulya nkumba. Nomba kuliya nambi muntu umo walikumupa byakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Lino mpwalekalikana mano mumoyo wakendi walambeti, basebenshi bonse ba bata bakute byakulya bingi balekutunga, lino ame kuno ndayandanga kufwa kunsala. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ndanyamukunga njenga kuli bata njengambeti, Ta, ndalepisha kuli Lesa ne kuli njamwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Nkandelela kukwiweti mwanenu, nsombi munsuminishe nsanduke musebenshi wenu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino walanyamuka nekubwelela kuli baishi.</para>
  <para style="p">“Nkacili patali baishi balamubona, lino bamunyumfwila inkumbo, ne kumukonka akumukumbata ne kumumyanguta mwakukondwa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mwana uyo walabambila baisheti, ta, ndalepisha kuli Lesa ne kuli amwe. Nkandelelela kukwiweti mwanenu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba baishi balambila basebenshi babo eti, ‘Kamufwambanani mulete byakufwala byaina afwale. Mumufwalike likosa kumunwe ne nkwabilo kumyendo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Salaniponi ng'ombe yansuka inene mushine kwambeti tulye tukondwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pakwinga uyu mwaname wanga wafwa, lino laba muyumi kayi wanga wataika lino lacaniki.’ Pacindici balatatika kusekelela.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pacindico mukulene bantu walikuba kulibala. Lino mpwalashika pepi ne ng'anda, walanyumfwa bantu bali kabembila ne kushana ne kulubisha. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Walakuwa musebenshi umo nekumwipusheti, “cilenshikinga kuno nicani?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Musebenshi walakumbuleti, “Mukwenu lesa neco baiso bamushinini ng'ombe yansuka inene pakwinga lesa nkali muyumi.” <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpwalanyumfweco popelapo walakalala kayi walakana nekwingila mung'anda. Nomba baishi balapula pansa kuya kumukombeleleti engile mung'anda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nendi walakumbula baishi eti, kamubonani! byaka kufula mbyondamusebensele eti ndemusha kayi ndiyawa kumwipishilapo nambi pang'ana nomba muliya kumpapo nambi kapongo konka kwambeti kondwepo nebaname. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nsombi mwanenu uyu walononga buboni bwenu mubatukashi bapombo, mpwalesa kung'anda, mulamushinini ng'ombe yansuka! <verse number="31" style="v"/>Baishi balamwambileti, “Omwaname, obe uli nenjame cindi conse kayi bintu byonse mbyonkute nibyakobe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nsombi lino katukondwa nekusekelela pakwinga kanike wakobe walikuba wafwa, lino nimuyumi, walikuba wataika, lino lacaniki.”</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa Kapitawo wacenjela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walabambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, Kwalikuba muntu mubile walikukute kapitawo weshi kubona buboni. Bantu balamwamba muntu uyo eti lonongonga buboni bwa mwami wakendi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino walakuwa kapitawo wabuboni nekumwipusheti, “Nomba nicani ncondanyufunga pali njobe? Mpandulwile sha bukapitawo bwakobe pakwinga nkowelela kuba kapitawo sobwe.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino kapitawo walatatika kuyeya mumoyo mwakendi eti, “Ninjiseconi mwami wakame layandanga kumfunya incito? Ndiya ngofu shakulima kayi kusenga kukutekumpa insoni. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino nceti njinse nici, kwambeti bantu bakantambule mumandabo, ndakafuma incito.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino walatika kukuwa bonse balikukute nkongole ku mwami wakendi umo ne umo nekwipusha mutanshi eti, “Walakweleta shingaye kumwami wakame?” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neye walakumbuleti, “Ndalakweleta mingomo mwanda ya mafuta”. Neco kapitawo uyo walamwambileti, “Manta lipepa apo palembwa nkongole yakobe, ufwambane wikale panshi ulembepo eti, mingomo yakwana makumi asanu.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino walepusha umbi eti, “Nomba obe walakweleta shingaye?” Walakumbuleti, “Ndalakweleta masaka ali mwanda a maila.” Lino neye walamwambileti, “Manta Lipepa palembwa nkongole yakobe, Ulembepo masaka makumi asanu ne atatu.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mwami wakendi uyo walalumbaisha kapitawo wa buboni wabula kushomeka pakucenjela kwakendi. Pakwinga bantu ba mucishi ca panshi pano nibasongo pa kubamba makani abo kupita bantu bali mu mumuni wa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu walapitilisha kubambileti, “Ndamwambilinga kamulicanina banenu babuboni bwa mucishi cino kwambeti, buboni bwakapwa nibakamutambule mumanda amuyayaya. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense washomeka pabintu bing'ana, nakashomeke pa bintu bingi. Uyo wabula kushomeka pabintu bing'ana, nteshi akashomeke pabintu bingi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino na nkamwashomeka pabuboni bwa pacishi cino, nomba niyani eti akamushome nekumupani buboni bwancincine? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Na kamulimwabula kushomeka pabuboni bwa bantu bambi, nomba niyani eti akamupeni buboni bwelela kuba bwenu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kuliya musebenshi wela kusebensela bami babili, pakwinga ukute kupatapo umbi nekusuna umbi, nambi kunyumfwila umbi nekusula umbi. Anu ekwambeti nkamwela kusebensela Lesa ne buboni.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwiyisha kwa Yesu nakumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12-13">Mateyo 11:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31-32">5:31-32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bafalisi mpolabanyumfwa makani aya balatatika kushibuluka Yesu pakwinga balo balikusunisha mali. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walabambileti, “Amwe mukute kulibonesha kubantu eti mwalulama, necikabeco Lesa winshi myoyo yenu. Pakwinga bintu byonse bantu mbyobakute kwambeti byaina, nsombi kuli Lesa kuliya mobibelele.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose ne Maswi alalemba bashinshimi byali kusebensa cindi ca Yohane mubatishi. Kufuma pacindico Mulumbe Waina wa Bwami bwa Lesa ukute kukambaukwa, kayi ne bantu bangi baleleshenga ne ngofu kwambeti bengile mu Bwami ubu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nsombi capuba kwambeti kwilu necishi kupwa, kupita liswi limo lya Milawo kupwa ngofu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Muntu uliyense laleke mukashendi nekweba mukashi naumbi, lenshi bupombo. Neye uyo lebe mutukashi ngwalaleka munendi lenshinga bupombo”.</para>
  <para style="s">Muntu mubile ne Lazalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kwalikuba muntu mubile walikufwala byadula uyo walikulya cena lyonse. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino kwalikuba muntu wapenga lina lyakendi walikuba Lazalo. Walikukute bilonda mubili wonse, walikusuna kona pa cishinga ca ng'anda ya muntu mubile uyo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lazalo walikaminina mate uto twakulya twalikulaka panshi pa tebulu ya muntu mubile uyo, naboyo bakabwa bali kabesa akumyanguta pabilonda byakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Muntu wapenga uyo walafwa, bangelo balamutwala kwilu mumakasa a Abulahamu. Muntu mubile uyo neye walafwa nekumufukila mumanda. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino mubile uyo mpwalikupenga mumusena wa bafu, walalanga kwilu nekubona Lazalo kulubasu lwa Abulahamu nkali patali. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino walolobesha eti, “Ta Abulahamu kamunyumfwilako inkumbo. Kamutumani Lazalo kwambeti abike cikumo cakendi mumenshi kwambeti atontoshe lulemi lwakame pakwinga ndashupiki mumulilo muno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino Abulahamu walambeti, “Mwaname kwanuka mpowalikuba muyumi walatambula bintu byonse byaina, neye Lazalo walatambula bintu byeshikubaba. Lino neye kuno wakondwa, obe uli mumapensho anene. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kayi pakati petu nenjobe pali cisengu, cakwambeti kuliya muntu ulikuno wela kucikonsha kusabuka kwisa uko, nambi uli uko kwisa kuno.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kufumapo mubile uyo walambeti, “Anu ndasengenga Ta, mutume Lazalo kung'anda ya bata. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Pakwinga nkute bakwetu basanu. Enga abacenjeshe kwambeti naboyo batakesa kumusena wa mapensho kuno.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nsombi Abulahamu walambeti, “abo bakute mabuku alalembwa ne Mose ne bashinshimi, kabanyumfwani byalembwamo.” <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nendi walakumbuleti, sobwe ta Abulahamu, na umbi ufuma kubafu nekuyako, mpobela kusanduka kubwipishi bwabo. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Abulahamu walamwambileti, “na nkabanyumfwilinga Mabala alalembwa ne Mose ne bashinshimi nteshi bakanyumfwepo nambi umbi akapunduke kubafu.”</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bwipishi ne kulekelela bantu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mateyo 18:6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Maliko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Bintu bikute kulengesha muntu kwambeti aipishe nibikaboneke, nsombi mapensho nakabe pali bantu beshikubileta. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba caina kwambeti muntu uyo asungwe ne libwe linene lya mwampelo munshingo ne kumuwala mu lwenje, kupita kulengesha umo wa bana bang'ana aba kwipisha.” <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neco kamucenjelani!</para>
  <para style="p">Na mukwenu lakwipishili, umukalalile, na lasenge kulekelelwa umulekelele. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Na lakwipishili mankanda asanu ne abili pabusuba bumo, kayi mankanda onse ayo kesa kuli njobe nekwambeti, “Ndepishi,” Welela kumulekelela.</para>
  <para style="s">Sha lushomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino batumwa balambila Mwami eti, “Kamukonempesha lushomo lwetu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mwami Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nemwabanga ne lushomo lulyeti luseke lwa masitadi, ngamucikonsha kwambila citondo eti, ‘Shukuka apo ulishimpike mumulonga, nacoyo ngacimunyumfwila.’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Sha musebenshi wabula ncito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Nomba naumbi pakati penu kakute musebenshi shikulima mulibala nambi kwembela mbelele. Nomba sena akomboka ngomwambila eti, ‘Fwambana kwesa ulye cakulya’ <verse number="8" style="v"/>Sobwe nkela kwinseco! Nsombi ngomwambileti, ‘Kontelekela cakulya, na upwishe ufwale cena nekundetela byakulya, lino ndapwisha nenjobe mpoti ulye ne kunwa.’ <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino sena ngomulumba musebenshi pakwinga lenshi ncowamwambila? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Copeleco nenjamwe, na mulenshi ncomwalambilwa mwelela kwambeti, ‘To basebenshi babula kwelela kutambula kantu. Pakwinga tulenshi mulimo wetu!’ ”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lashilikinga beshi mankuntu bali likumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalikuya ku Yelusalemu, walapita panyinsa ya Samaliya ne Galileya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mpwalashika mumunshi naumbi, beshimankuntu bali likumi balamukumanya ne kwimana pataliko. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino balobelesheti, “Amwe Yesu, Nkambo kamutunyumfwilako nkumbo!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalababona walabambileti, “Kamuyani ku beshimilumbo baye bamuboneti mulaba cena.” Lino mpobalikuya kwenda munshila, balaba cena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino umo pakati pabo mpwalaboneti laba cena, walabwelela kuli Yesu nkaya akulumbaisha Lesa ne liswi lyapelu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino mpwalashika kuli Yesu walafukama kuntangu kwakendi ne kumulumba. Shimankuntu uyu walikuba mu Samaliya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Sena bashilikwa nkabanga likumi? Nomba bambi basanu ne bana balikupe? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nomba nicani kulesowa muswamashi enka kwisa kulumbaisha Lesa? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kufumapo, Yesu walambila shimankuntu uyo, pakwinga wanshoma nyamuka koya, Lushomo lwakobe lulakushiliki.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Bwami bwa Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateyo 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Bafalisi bambi balepusha Yesu eti, “Bwami bwa Lesa nibukese lilyoni?” Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Bwami bwa Lesa, nteshi bukese mwakubonekela ne menso sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kuliya weshi akambeti, ‘Nibuno bulikuno!’ Nambi eti, ‘Nibusa kusa!’ Pakwinga Bwami bwa Lesa buli pakati penu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino walakumbula beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Nicikashike cindi mpoti mukayande kubona Mwana Muntu mubusuba bumo, nomba nteshi mukabubonepo sobwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nikukabe bantu beshi bakamwambileti, ‘Kamubona nte busa bulikusa, nambi eti, ubu bulipano, mutakayako nambi kubakonkela sobwe.’ <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pakwinga mbuli kubyasha ncokukute kucilingana mwilu nekubonekela kumbasu shonse, enceti kukabe pabusuba bwakwisa Mwana Muntu. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nsombi welela kutanguna kupenshewa, nekukanwa ne bantu ba cino cindi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Mbuli ncocalikuba mumasuba a Nowa encoti cikabe mumasuba a Mwana Muntu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mucindico bantu bali kabalya, ne kunwa, kweba kayi ne kwebwa kushikila busuba Nowa mbwalengila mubwato. Lino muyoba unene walesa nekubononga bonse. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nicikabeti ncocalikuba mucindi ca Loti, bantu bali kabalya ne kunwa, kula ne kulisha, kubyala ne kwibaka manda. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nsombi busuba Loti mpwalafuma mu Sodomu, Lesa walalasha mulilo wa salufa walalaka kwilu nekubononga bonse. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nicikabe copeleco pabusuba Mwana Muntu mpoti akese.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Busuba ubo, uyo eti akabenga paciluli ca ng'anda atakaseluketi amante bintu byakendi mung'anda, neye uyo eti akabenga mulibala atakabwelela kung'anda. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kamwanukani muka Loti! <verse number="33" style="v"/>Uyo layandanga kupulusha buyumi bwakendi, nakabutaye. Nsombi uyo latayanga buyumi bwakendi pacebo cakame, nakabupulushe. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga pabusuba ubo mashiku, bantu babili nibakabenga bona pabulili bumo, umo nakamantwe, umbi nakashale. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Batukashi babili nibakapelenga pantu pamo umo nakamantwe, umbi nakashale. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bantu babili nibakabenga mulibala, nsombi umo nakamantwe, umbi nakashale.” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balamwipusheti, “Mwami, nikupeyo nkoti bikenshikile ibi?” Yesu walakumbuleti, “Uko kulafwili cintu nawoyo makubi akute kubungana kopeloko.”</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa mukalubingi ne mubeteshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambila beshikwiya bakendi mukoshano, pakuyanda kubeyisha kwambeti bapailenga lyonse kwakubula kubwelela kunyuma. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Kwalikuba mubeteshi mumunshi umbi walikubula kutina Lesa nambi kulemeka muntu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwalikuba mukalubingi mutukashi mumunshi wopeloyo walikaya kuli shikubeteka ne kumusengeti, ‘Munyamfweko pa mulandu ngonkute ku mulwani wakame.’ <verse number="4" style="v"/>Masuba alafula mubeteshi kakanowa, nsombi panyuma pakendi walayeya mwineti, necikaba kwambeti nkantini Lesa nambi kulemeka muntu, <verse number="5" style="v"/>pakwinga mukalubingi uyu landemeshe kunjobekela, nindimubetekele mulandu wakendi, kwambeti ngaundemesha kwisa kuno!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino Mwami walambeti, “Nte mulanyumfu maswi amubeteshi wabula kululama usa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Sena Lesa nteshi akabetekeshe mulandu wa balulama bakendi abo balamusengenga munshi ne mashiku? Sena nakalilwe kubanyamfwa? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ndamwambilingeti nakafwambane kubabetekela mulandu wabo. Sena pakwisa Mwana Muntu nakacane bantu bakute lushomo panshi pano?”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa Mufalisi ne weshikusonkesha musonko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walamba mukoshano umbi kulyabo bali kabayeyeti balulama kupita bonse nekunyansha banabo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Kwalikuba bantu babili balaya akupaila ku Ng'anda ya Lesa. Umbi walikuba Mufalisi naumbi walikuba weshimisonko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Lino Mufalisi walanyamuka nekupaileti, ndamulumbunga obe Lesa, pakwinga ame nkandipo eti bantu nabambi bonse. Nabo nibantu babula kululama kayi ni bapombo. Kayi ndalumbu pakwinga kandipo eti uyu weshi kusonkesha musonko uyu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ndalikanishinga kulya mankanda abili munsondo, kayi nkute kubenga calikumi pabintu byonse mbyonkute kucana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Nsombi weshikusonkesha musonko usa walemana patali, liya kulangapo kwilu. Nsombi walikalyuma pantiti nekwambeti, Lesa, kamunyumfwilako inkumbo ame ndemwipishi.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Cancine ncine, weshimusonko walabwelela kucomwabo kali walulama pamenso a Lesa, mu Falisi neye liya. Pakwinga muntu uliyense weshi kulisumpula nakacepeshewe, nomba muntu weshi kulicepesha nakasumpulwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalelekenga bana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateyo 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Bantu nabambi balaleta bana bang'ana kuli Yesu kwambeti abike makasa akendi pabana nekubaleleka. Beshikwiya bakendi mpobalaboneco balabakalalila bantu abo balaleta bana. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walakuwa bana nekwambeti. “Kamulekani bana bang'ana bese kuli njame, mutabakanishanga, pakwinga Bwami bwa Lesa ni bwa bantu balyeti bana aba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti uyo labulunga kutambula Bwami Bwa Lesa eti mwana, cakubinga nteshi akengilemo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Muntu mubile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateyo 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mukulene wa Bayuda naumbi walepusha Yesu eti. “Bashikwiyisha baina, nomba ndelelela kwinseconi kwambeti nkatambule buyumi butapu?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walepusheti, “Nomba nicani ncolambilico kwambeti ndaina? Kuliya muntu waina, nsombi Lesa enka. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Milawo uyinshi yeshi kwambeti, ‘Utensa bulale, utashina, kotaiba, utapa bukamboni bwabwepeshi, lemeka baiso ne banyoko.’” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Muntu uyo walakumbuleti, “Iyi Milawo yonse nkute kwikonka kufuma kubutwanike bwakame.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalanyumfweco, walamwambileti, “Kulashalowa cintu cimo ncowelela kwinsa. Koya ulishe byonse mbyokute, mali upe bapenga, lino nukabe nebuboni kwilu. Wenseco, wise unkonkele.” <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nsombi muntu usa mpwalanyumfweco, walongumana pakwinga walikuba ne mubile bwingi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalabona, kungumana kwa muntu usa walambeti, “Cayuma kwambeti bantu babile bakengile mu Bwami bwa Lesa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Capuba kwambeti ngamila ingile mukamulyango ka nyeleti kupita muntu mubile kwingila mu Bwami bwa Lesa.” <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bantu balanyumfwa makani aya balepusheti, “Nomba niyani eti akapuluke?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ibi bintu bitakonsheke nebantu, bikute kukonsheka ne Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino Petulo walambeti, “Kamubona! Afwe twalashiya manda etu nekukonkela njamwe.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga paliya muntu walashiya ng'anda, nambi mukashendi nambi bamakwabo nambi bashali bakendi nambi bana bakendi pacebo ca Bwami bwa Lesa, <verse number="30" style="v"/>eti akabule kutambula bintu bingi pacino cindi, kayi mucindi cilesanga nakatambule buyumi butapu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga shalufu lwakendi kabutatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateyo 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33-34">Maliko 10:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesu walamanta beshikwiya bakendi bali likumi ne babili kuya palubasu nekubambileti, “Tulenga ku Yelusalemu uko byonse byalalemba bashinshimi pa Mwana Muntu nkoti bikenshikile. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mwana Muntu nakatwalwe mumakasa abantu bakunsa abo beshi bakamuwele, kumutukana, nekumusankila mata. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nibakamukwipe nekumushina, nsombi pabusuba bwabutatu nakapundushiwe kubafu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Beshikwiya bakendi baliya kunyumfwishisha pamakani ayo. Maswi aya baliya kwanyumfwishisha pakwinga alikuba asolama kuli endibo, neco baliya kwinshiba ncali kwamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lasenguluga muntu mpofu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateyo 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika pepi ne Yeliko walacana mpofu kali wekala mumbali mwa nshila, kasengelela. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino mpofu uyo mpwalanyumfwa bantu bangi kabapita munshileyo, walepusheti, “Nicani cilenshikinga?” <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bantu balamwambileti, “Ni Yesu wa ku Nasaleti lapitinga.” <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino walolobesheti, “Yesu mwana wa Dafeti konyumfwilako inkumbo!” <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino bantu balikuba kutangu balamukalilila nekumwambileti mwena. Nsombi nendi walapitilisha kolobesheti, “Mwanendi Dafeti, konyumfwilako inkumbo!” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Neye Yesu walemana ne kwambila bantu eti bamulete kuli endiye. Mpwalashika pepi Yesu walamwipusheti, <verse number="41" style="v"/>nicani ncolandangeti nkwinshile? Neye walamukumbuleti, “Mwami, ndayandanga kwambeti ntatike kubona kayi.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walamwambileti, “Tatika kubona, pakwinga ulanshomo, lushomo lwakobe lulakushiliki.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Pacindi copeleco walatatika kubona. Lino walakonkela Yesu nkaya kulumbaisha Lesa. Bantu bonse mpobalabona calenshika naboyo balalalumbaisha Lesa.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu ne Sakeyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walengila mu Yeliko, nekupitilila. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mu Yeliko mopelomo mwalikuba muntu wali kukwiweti Zakeyo. Walikuba shikusonkesha misonko mukulene, kayi walikuba mubile. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Walikuyandishisha kubona Yesu ncabele nomba walikuba mufupi, walalilwa kumubona pakwinga bantu balafulisha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco walafwambila kuntangu ne kutanta mu citondo ca mukuyu kwambeti amubone, pakwinga Yesu empalikupitila popelapo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalashika pamusenapo walalanga kwilu nekumwambileti, “Zakeyo, fwambana seluka pakwinga ndelela kuya kwikala kung'anda yakobe lelo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino Zakeyo walaseluka cakufwambana nekutambula Yesu mwakukondwa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino bantu bonse balabonako, balatatika kudandaula ne kwambeti, “Kamubonani muntu uyu lenga kwikala kung'anda ya muntu mwipishi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba Zakeyo walanyamuka nekwambila Mwami eti, “Mwami,kamubonani, ninkape buboni bwakame kupa bapenshi. Na ndalamanta kantu kumuntu munshila yabula kwelela, ndimubweshele mankanda ana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesu walamwambileti, “Lelo kupuluka kulesa mung'anda ino, pakwinga muntu uyu neye nimwanendi Abulahamu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco Mwana Muntu walesa kuyandaula nekupulusha bataika.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mukoshano wa mali a golidi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateyo 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bantu kabacinyumfwa mbyalikwamba Yesu,walapitilisha kayi kubambila mukoshano pakwinga balashika pepi ku Yelusalemu. Nomba bantu bali kabayeyeti Bwami bwa Lesa buli pepi kwisa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino walambeti, “Kwalikuba muntu, walikuba walemekwa uyo walaya kucishi ca kutali kuya kupewa bwami nekubwelela kayi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Katanaya walakuwa basebenshi bakendi nekupa mali a golide likumi ku musebenshi umo ne umo” Nekubambileti, “kamwinsanga makwebo mpaka nkabwele.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino bantu mbwalikwikala nabo mucishi umo nkabali kumuyanda, neco balatuma ntumwi kuya kucishico akwambeti, “Afwe nkatulayandanga muntu uyo kuba mwami wetu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Necikabeco muntu uyo walaya kupewa bwami busa, lino mpwalabwela kwabo, walakuwa basebenshi bakendi abo mbwalapa mali kwambeti,bamwambile bwili mbwacanapo umo ne umo.” <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino musebenshi mutanshi walesa walambeti, “Nkambo pamali ngomwalampa ndacaninipo bwili bwa mali ali likumi.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino mwami wakendi walamwambileti, “Ulenshi cena, Omusebenshi waina! Pakwinga walashomeka mubintu bing'ana nube weshikwendelesha minshi ili likumi.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neye musebenshi wabubili walesa walambeti, “Mwami pamali asanu ngomwalampa ndacaninipo bwili bwa mali ali asanu.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mwami walamwambileti, “Obe nube weshikwendelesha minshi isanu.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lino musebenshi naumbi walesa walambeti, “Mwami, mali enu ndalasunga pakakwisa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ndalatina pakwinga mobakalu, mukute kutambula byabula byenu nekutebula mbyomwabula kubyala.” <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mwami wakendi walakumbuleti, “Obe musebenshi waipa! Lino ninkutoteke kwelana ne maswi ngolamba. Ucishi kwambeti ndemukalu, nkute kumanta byabula byakame nekutebula mpondabula kubyala. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba uliya kubikila cani ku banki mali akame, kwambeti pakubwelela ncane bwili?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Lino walambila balikubapo eti, ‘Mulamuneni mali ayo mupe ukute mali likumi.’ <verse number="25" style="v"/>Balo balambeti, ‘Mwami, uyo ukute kendi mali ali likumi.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nsombi mwami walakumbuleti, ndamwambilinga ukute kantu nakabikilwepo nabimbi, nsombi uyo ukute kang'ana nibakamunyongomone nako konse kankute. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lino balwani bakame abo bali kuyandeti ame ntaba mwami wabo, kamubaleta kuno mubashine kambonako!”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lengilinga mu Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyo 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohane 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesu mpwalapwisha kwambeco, walabatangunina kuya ku Yelusalemu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mpwalashika pepi ne minshi ya Betifagi ne Betaniya pepi ne mulundu wa maolifi walatuma beshikwiya bakendi babili, <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nekubambileti, “Kamuyani mumunshi usa ngomulabononga. Mwashika, nimucane mwana wambongolo kali wasungwa uyo utana utantwapo kendi ne bantu, muye mumusungulule, mumulete kuno.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="15 Colt.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="19:30">Mwanambongolo</figure> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Na umbi muntu amwipusheti, ‘Mulamusungulilinga cani’ Mumwambileti, ‘Mwami ukute nendi incito.’”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nicakubinga beshikwiya babili basa balaya kucana mbuli ncalabamba Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mpobali kusungulula mbongolo, bene balepusheti, “Nomba mulamusungulwilinga cani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Nabo balakumbuleti, “Mwami ukute nendi incito.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino balatwala mbongolo kuli Yesu, nekutatika kuyansa byakufwala byabo pelu nekumutantikapo Yesu. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalikuya kali watanta mbongolo, bantu balayansa byakufwala byabo munshila kulesha bulemu kulyendiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mpwalashika pepi neku Yelusalemu mwinshi mwa mulundu wa maolifi, likoto linene lya beshikwiya bali kabamukonkela balatatika kukondwa. Kayi balumbaisha Lesa ne maswi a pelu pacebo ca incito ya ngofu njobalabona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Balambeti, “Walelekwa Mwami uyo lesanga mulina lya Lesa. Lumuno kwilu ne bulemu bube kuli Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Lino Bafalisi nabambi balikuba mulikoto balambila Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, kamwambilani beshikwiya benu bamwene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ndamwambilinga na aba bamwene, mabwe nawo nawolobeshe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalilinga pacebo ca Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalashika pepi nekubona Yelusalemu, walalila. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Na obe newalenshiba lelo, bintu byeshikuleta lumuno! Nsombi nkobishi pakwinga menso akobe nkela kubibona. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Necikabeco nicikashike cindi balwani bakobe mpoti bakakushinguluke nekukushinkila konse konse. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Nibakakumwayaule nekushina bantu bakobe bonse. Nteshi bakashiye libwe pelu palinendi, pakwinga uliyawa kwishiba cindi Lesa ncalesa akukupulusha.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu latandanyanga bantu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateyo 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohane 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Yesu walengila mu Ng'anda ya Lesa nekutatika kutandanyamo abo bali kabolisha mukati mulubuwa lwa Ng'anda ya Lesa, <verse number="46" style="v"/>walabambileti, “Calembwa Mumabala a Lesa kwambeti, ‘Ng'anda yakame nikakwiweti Ng'anda yakupaililamo.’ Nsombi amwe mulaisandulu kuba ng'anda mwakuyubila bakapondo!” <verse number="47" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walikeyisha lyonse mu Ng'anda ya Lesa. Nomba bamakulene beshimilumbo, beshikwiyisha Milawo ne batangunishi ba Bayuda balikuyanda kumushina, <verse number="48" style="v"/>Lino balabula cakwinsa pakwinga bantu bonse balikuba nendi cindi conse kwambeti banyumfwe maswi akendi.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho pa ngofu sha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateyo 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nabumbi busuba Yesu mpwalikwiyisha nekukambauka Mulumbe Waina mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, bamakulene beshimilumbo, beshikwiyisha Milawo kayi ne bamakulene ba Bayuda balesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Balepusheti, “Kotwambila, nomba ningofucini nshokute pakwinsa bintu ibi? Wakupa ngofu shakwinsa ibi bintu niyani?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nenjame ndamwipushunga mwipusho umo. Kamungambilani, <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba niyani walapa Yohane ngofu shakubatisha? Sena ni Lesa nambi nibantu?” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nabo balatatika kwipushana bonka eti, “Na twambeti, ni Lesa, nendi natwipusheti, ‘Nomba nicani muliya kumushoma? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lino na twambeti, nibantu, bantu bonse nibatuwale mabwe pakwinga bacinsheti Yohane walikuba mushinshimi.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco balakumbuleti, “Nkatucinshi na walashifunya kupeyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Nenjame anu nteshi ndimwambile uyo walampa ngofu shakwinsa bintu ibi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Balimi balabweleka libala lya minyombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateyo 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walapitilisha kubambila bantu mukoshanyo eti, Kwalikuba muntu walalima libala lyaminyansa ne kulibwelekesha balimi, lino walaya pabulwendo bwa kucishi nacimbi, uko nkwalekala cindi citali. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mpocalashika cindi cakutebula bisepo, muntu uyo, walatuma musebenshi wakendi kubalimi abo kwambeti bamupeko bisepo byamulibala lyakendi. Nsombi balimi abo balekata musebenshi uyo nekumuma nekumutandanya kwabula kumupapo kantu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mwine libala walatumako naumbi musebenshi. Neye balamuma, ne kumusebanya, kayi nekumutandanya kwakubula kantu mumakasa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino walatumako naumbi wabutatu, nsombi neye balamupwayaula nekumutaila kunsa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino mwine libala uyo walambeti, “Ninjiseconi lino? Anu nintumeko mwaname ngonsunishi mpani nendi nibenga bamupe bulemu.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nsombi balimi abo mpobalamubona, balatatika kwambilaneti, “Uyu endiye weshi akapyane buboni bonse, katumushina kwambeti buboni bonse bukabe bwetu.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco balamukwelela pansa pa libala nekumushina. Lino Yesu walabepusheti,</para>
  <para style="p">“Nomba nicani nceshi akense mwine libala kubalimi abo? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nakese akubashina balimi abo nekupa bambi libala ilyo.”</para>
  <para style="p">Bantu basa mpobalanyumfweco balambeti, “Citakenshika.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu walabalangishisha nekubepusheti, lino malembo ayo akute kwamba cani?</para>
  <para style="q">“Libwe ilyo ndyobalakana beshikwibaka,</para>
  <para style="q">lyalaba elibwe lya pakona pa ng'anda</para>
  <para style="q">lyayandika.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Muntu uliyense weshi akawile pa libwe ili nakatyokauke. Nsombi uyo weshi likamulakile, nakasansauke.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mwipusho wa kubenga musonko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateyo 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Beshikwiyisha Milawo ne bamakulene beshimilumbo bali kuyanda kwikata Yesu pacindi copeleco pakwinga balenshibeti Yesu walikwamba endibo mumukoshanyo uyo. Nsombi balatina bantu balikubapo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Neco nabo balikabalangaula cindi caina, balatuma bantu kwambeti bamweleshe, palikulibonesheti balulama mung'ambilo yabo kwambeti bamuteye kose mukwamba, kwambeti benga bamubepeshele kuli bendeleshi, pakwinga neye walikukute ngofu ne bwendeleshi bonse. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bantu abo balepusha Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, tucinshi kwambeti mukute kwamba ne kwiyisha byalulama. Nkamukute kulanga eti uyu niyani. Nsombi mukute kwiyisha Milawo ya Lesa cancine ncine. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kamutwambila, sena Milawo ya Lesa yasuminisha kubenga musonko ku mwami waku Loma, nambi nkayasuminisha?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walenshiba miyeyo yabo yaipa walabambileti, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Kamundesha mali, nomba cinso ne lina lilipo nilyabani?” Balakumbuleti, “Byonse nibya mwami waku Loma.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino neye walakumbuleti, “Kamubengani ku mwami waku Loma bintu byakendi, Neco neye Lesa mupeni bintu byakendi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neco balalilwa kucana mulandu mulibyo mbyalamba pamenso abantu. Lino balapwilwa mano pakukumbula kwa Yesu, balamwenowa tonto.</para>
  <para style="s">Shakupunduka kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateyo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Basaduki nabambi balesa kuli Yesu. Bantu aba bali kwambeti bantu bafwa nteshi bakapundukepo. Balamwipusha Yesu eti, <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Bashikwiyisha, Mose watulembela Milawo yakwambeti, Na muntu lafu, nekushiya mukashendi, kwakubula mwana, mukwabo welela kumweba mukalubingi kwambeti asemenemo bana bamukwabo uyo walafwa.” <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino kwalikuba batuloba basanu ne babili pamukowa, mukulene bantu waleba mukashi, nsombi walafwa katana asemenamo mwana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Neye wabubili walamupyana mukashi nomba neye walafwa katana asemenamo mwana, <verse number="31" style="v"/>Wabutatu walamupyana neye walafwa katana asemenamo mwana. Lino bonse basa basanu ne babili balapwa kufwa kwakubula kusemenamo bana mumutukashi uyo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kumapwilisho, mukashi uyo walafwa neye. <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Lino pabusuba bwakupunduka kubafu, mukashi uyo nakabe muka bani? Pakwinga bonse bamukowa basanu ne babili balikuba balamwebepo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Bantu bacino cindi bakute kweba nekwebwa. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nsombi abo beti bakapundushiwe kubafu nekwikala mubuyumi bulesanga, nteshi bakebanenga. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Nabo nibakekalengeti bangelo, kayi nteshi bakafwepo. Balo nibakabe bana ba Lesa pakwinga balapunduku kubafu. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nomba pamakani akupunduka kubafu, neye Mose walambapo, pamakani a cifukusa cisa calikubangila mulilo, pakwinga Mwami walambeti, ‘Ni Lesa wa Abulahamu ni Lesa wa Isaki kayi ni Lesa wa Yakobo.’ <verse number="38" style="v"/>Anu ekwambeti nte Lesa wa bantu bafwa, nsombi Lesa ni Lesa wabantu bayumi, pakwinga pamenso akendi bantu bonse nibayumi.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Beshikwiyisha Milawo nabambi balakumbuleti, “Bashikwiyisha mulamba cena” <verse number="40" style="v"/>Neco baliya kuyanda kumwipushapo Yesu mipusho naimbi.</para>
  <para style="s">Klistu Mwanendi Dafeti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateyo 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “nipacebo cini bantu bakute kwambeti Mupulushi Walaiwa nimwanendi Dafeti?” <verse number="42" style="v"/><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kutembaula 110 vs 1-2</char></note> Pakwinga Dafeti mwine mulibuku lya kutembaula walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mwami walambila Mwami wakame eti,</para>
  <para style="q">Ikala kulikasa lyakame lyakululyo</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>kushikila nkasandule balwani bakobe,</para>
  <para style="q">bakabe pakulyata myendo yakobe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Na Dafeti mwine walamukuweti, Mwami, nomba ngobeconi mwanendi?”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lacenjeshenga bantu sha beshikwiyisha Milawo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyo 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Maliko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Bantu bonse mpobalikunyumfwa mbyalikwamba Yesu, nendi walabambila beshikwiya bakendi eti, <verse number="46" style="v"/>“Kamucenjelani ne beshikwiyisha Milawo. Nabo basuni kwendana kabalibafwala minganjo itali, kwambeti bantu babapenga mitende yabulemu mumisena yamakwebo. Basuni kwikala pabipuna byabulemu mung'anda yakupaililamo ne mumisena yamalyalya. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nomba ebakute kulamuna manda bamukalubingi, ne kupaila mipailo itali itali kwambeti bantu bababone. Cakubinga Lesa nakabape mulandu kupita bantu nabambi balabulunga kwinseco.”</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bupe bwa mutukashi mukalubingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Maliko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesu walalangishisha, walabona bantu babile kababika bipo byabo mucakubikamo bipo byamali mu Ng'anda ya Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walabona mutukashi mukalubingi kabikamo tumali tubili. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walambeti, “Ndamwambilinga cakubinga uyu mukalubingi wapenga labikimo bupe bwapitapo bambi bonse. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga bonse aba, balafunyu pa mali angi ngobakute, nsombi neye mubupenshi bwakendi labikimo mali onse ngakutenga mung'anda yakendi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambanga shakumwayiwa kwa Ng'anda ya Lesa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateyo 24:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Beshikwiya nabambi bali kabamba pamakani a Ng'anda ya Lesa eti balaibaka ne mabwe eshikuboneka cena, kayi nebipo byakutwala kuli Lesa. Lino Yesu walambeti, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Ibi byonse mbyomulabononga, nicikashike cindi mpoti kukabule libwe nambi limo lyeti likashale palibwe linendi, mabwe onse nakamwayaulwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makatasho ne mapensho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateyo 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya balepusha Yesu eti, “Bashikwiyisha, nomba ibi nibikenshike lilyoni? Kayi nitukenshibile kucani eti bintu byonse ibi bili pepi kwinshika?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Kamucenjelani kwambeti kutakaba muntu naba umo eti akamubepe. Pakwinga bantu bangi balakesanga mulina lyakame kabambeti, ‘Njame Mupulushi usa Walaiwa.’ Kayi eti, ‘cindi cilashiki.’ Mutakabakonkela. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mwakanyumfwa makani a nkondo kayi nebimfulunganya mubishi, mutakatina. Ibi bintu byelela kutanguna kwinshika, nomba nteko kwambeti mapwililisho a cishi alashiki.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walapitilisha kubambileti, “Bishi nibikalwane ne bishi nabimbi, nayoyo mishobo nikabukilane ne mishobo inabo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nikukabe mikukumo iyosha. Nikukabe nsala, malwashi ne lulanga mumisena yapusana pusana. Nikukenshike bintu byeshikuyosha nebingashilo byeshikukankamanisha kwilu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Nsombi byonse ibi kabitana binshika, nimukasungwe nekupenshewa. Nimukatwalwe mumanda akupaililamo, nimukabetekwe nekubikwa mujele. Nimukatwalwe ku bami ne baleli pacebo ca njame. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ici nicikabe cindi caina ca kukambauka Mulumbe Waina. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino mutakasukama mumyoyo kuyeyeti nitwambe cani pamulanduyu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pakwinga ninkamupe maswi a mano cakwambeti kuliya mulwani wenu eti akacikonshe kukana nambi kutoteka. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ne bamashali benu bonse, bamakwenu, beshikamukowa, nebanenu, nibakamutwale kubalwani benu, bambi pakati penu nibakamushine. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Bantu bonse nibakamupate pacebo ca njame. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Necikabeco kuliya mushishi nambi umo wenu weshi ukataike. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mukalimbikile cakubula kubwelela munyuma nimukatambule buyumi bwenu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu walamba shakumwaiwa kwa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateyo 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Maliko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mwakaboneti munshi wa Yelusalemu ulashingulukwa ne beshi nkondo, mukenshibeti konongeka kwawo kulashiki. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Lino abo bali mu Yudeya bakafwambile kumilundu, abo beshi bakabenga mukati mu Yelusalemu bakapulemo, balikumabala kabatakengila mu Yelusalemu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakwinga ici nicikabe cindi cacisubulo, kwambeti byonse bisa byalalembwa mumabala bikenshike. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Batukashi beti bakabenga ne mabunda nibakabe mumapensho, nabo beshi bakabenga ne bana balayamwanga mumasubayo. Pakwinga nikukabe mapensho anene mucishici, kayi ne bukalu bwa Lesa nibukabe pabantu bamu Isilaeli. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nabambi nibakayaswe bibeshi kayi nibakamantwe busha kubantu bamishobo imbi. Lino Yelusalemu nikalyataulwe ne baswamashi kushikila cindi cabo cikapwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwisa kwa Mwana Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateyo 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Kulakabanga bingashilo kulisuba ne kumwenshi ne kunyenyenshi. Pacishi pano, bantu nibakalisukame nekutina pakunyumfwa kuwota kwa lwenje ne mankape. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bantu nibakawisuke ne buyowa pakulangilila bilandanga kwinshika mucishi ca panshi conse, pakwinga ngofu sha kwilu nishikatenkanishiwe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lino nibakabone ame nde Mwana Muntu kanjisa mumakumbi nengofu kayi nebulemu bunene. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino bintu ibi byakatatika kwinshika, mukanyamuke nekwinuna mitwi yenu, pakwinga kulubulwa kwenu kulasenene pepi.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lwiyo ku citondo ca mukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateyo 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambila mukoshano eti, “Kamulangani mukuyu nebitondo bimbi byonse. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Na mulabono matewu atatiki kusonsa mukute kwishibeti cilimo cili pepi. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Copeleco nenjamwe mwakabona bintu ibi kabinshika mukenshibe kwambeti Bwami bwa Lesa buli pepi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Ndamwambilinga cakubingeti musemano uwu nteti ukapwe kufwa bintu ibi kabitana binshika. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kwilu ne cishi ca panshi nibikapite, nsombi maswi akame nteshi akapwepo ngofu sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labacenjeshenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Kamucenjelani kwambeti mutaba bantu basuni kulya ne kusekelela malyalya, nekukolwa kayi nekusukama pa bintu bya buyumi buno, pakwinga busuba ubo ngabwisa mwakutenshiba eti kose. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nibukese bushikubo pabantu bonse bekala pa cishi capanshi <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ikalani mwalibambila lyonse, nekupaila cindi conse, kwambeti mube nengofu shakupuluka kubintu ibi byeshibikeshike, kwambeti mukemane pamenso pa Mwana Muntu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Masuba ayo, Yesu walikeyisha mu Ng'anda ya Lesa, nsombi mashiku lyonse walikuya ku mulundu wa maolifi akwikala. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lino mumenemene bantu bangi bali kabaya ku Ng'anda ya Lesa kuya kukutika kwiyisha kwakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Balapangananga shakushina Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyo 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohane 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bushiku bwakukondwa bwa kulya shinkwa wabula cishikufufumusha, ubo bwalikukwiweti Pasika mpobwalashika pepi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo, ne beshikwiyisha Milawo balikabayandaula nshila yakushininamo Yesu. Nomba bali kutina bantu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi lapangananga shakumuyaba Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateyo 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Satana walengila muli Yudasi, walikukwiweti Isikalyoti, uyo walikuba umo wa beshikwiya bali likumi ne babili ba Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neco Yudasi walaya kupangana ne bamakulene beshimilumbo ne beshikwendelesha Ng'anda ya Lesa ncobela kwinsa kwambeti amuyabe Yesu kulyendibo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Lino balakondwa, kayi balasuminishana kumulipila mali. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yudasi walasumina ne kutatika kuyandaula cindi caina cakumuyabilapo, bantu bonse kabatacinshi.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lalibambilinga kulya Pasika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateyo 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohane 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bwalashika busuba bwakukondwa bwakulya shinkwa wakutafufumusha, busuba bwakushina twana twambelele twakulya pabusuba bwa Pasika. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walatuma Petulo ne Yohane ne kubambileti, “Kamuyani mutubambile byakulya bya pabusuba bwa Pasika kwambeti tulye.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Balo balamwipusheti, “Nikupeyo nkomulayandanga kwambeti twenga tubambile?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesu walabambileti, “Kamunyumfwani! mwengila mu Yelusalemu nimucane mutuloba wanyamuna nongo ya menshi, mu mukonkele mpaka mung'anda moshi engile. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Lino mu mwambile mwine ng'andeti, Bashikwiyisha balepushungeti, ‘Nomba cili kupeyo cipinda moshi balyele byakulya bya Pasika ne beshikwiya babo’ <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lino na amuboneshe cipinda cinene ca pelu cabambiwa cena, mopelomo emoti mutubambile byakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino balaya kucana bintu byonse mbuli mwalabambilila Yesu. Lino balatatika kubamba byakulya bya Pasika.</para>
  <para style="s">Cakulya ca mansailo ca Mwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateyo 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino mpocalashika cindi cakulya Yesu walekala pa tebulu pamo ne batumwa bakendi kwambeti balye. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Ndayandishishanga kulya Pasika pamo nenjamwe nkantana kutatika kupenshewa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ndamwambilinga cakubinga nteshi nkalyepo Pasika, kushikila cikakwanilishiwe mu Bwami bwa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lino Yesu mpwalamanta nkomeshi nekulumba Lesa, walabambileti, “Kamutambulani munwe mwense. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lino ndamwambilinga kufuma lelo nteshi nkanwepo waini, kushikila Bwami bwa Lesa bukese.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kufumapo Yesu walamanta shinkwa, walalumba Lesa, nekukomona nekupa beshikwiya bakendi nekwambeti, “Uyu emubili wakame ulayabwa cebo canjamwe. Kamwinsanga ici lyonse pakunganukila.” <verse number="20" style="v"/>Copeleco mpobalapwisha kulya mulalilo, Yesu walapa beshikwiya bakendi nkomeshi nekubambileti, “Nkomeshi iyi nicipangano calino lino ca Lesa, nemilopa yakame yeshi iketike pacebo cenu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Nsombi kamubona! Uyo lanjabanga kubalwani lalinga pamo nenjame patebulu pano. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mwana Muntu nakafwe kwelana ne kuyanda kwa Lesa. Nsombi muntu lamuyabanga Mwana Muntu nakapenge. Caina muntuyo nalabula kusemwa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya balatatika kulipusheti, nomba welakwinseco niyani pakati petu.</para>
  <para style="s">Inga mukulene niyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya balatatika kupikishaneti, “Inga niyani mukulene pakati petu?” <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Bami ba bantu bakunsa bakute ngofu pabantu babo kayi bakute kulyela masuku pamutwi bantu, bakute kukwiweti, ‘Beshikwinsa byaina kubantu.’ <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nsombi pakati penu citabanga mushoboyu. Cakubinga mukulene pali amwe abe weshikulicepesha kupita bonse, neye weshi kwendelesha abe musha wenu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Nomba mukulene niyani? Sena ni usa lalinga pa tebulu na ni musha? Sena nte usa lalyelenga pa tebulu? Nomba ame ndilyeti musha pakati penu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Amwe mulekala nenjame mumasunko akame onse. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lino copeleco, mbuli ba Ta ncobalampa ngofu shakwendelesha, nenjame nindimupeni ngofu. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Nimukalye ne kunwa pamo nenjame, kayi nimukekale pabipuna bya Bwami ne kubeteka mishobo likumi ne ibili ya ba Isilaeli.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lambilinga limo Petulo eti nakamukane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateyo 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohane 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Shimoni, Shimoni, nyumfwa! Satana layandanga kumupupulusha mumasunko mbuli mulimi ncakute kupupulusha maila. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nsombi ndakupailili kwambeti lushomo lwakobe lutapwa. Lino obe wakatembenuka mumuyo ukayuminishe banobe.” <verse number="33" style="v"/>Nsombi Petulo walakumbuleti, “Mwami, ame ndalibambila kuya nenjamwe mujele nambi kufwa.” <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walakumbuleti, “Ndakwambilinga Petulo, lelo kombwe nkatana alila, nunkane mankanda atatu eti nkonjinshipo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Makani akunyamuna mpotomona cola ne mupeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesu walepusha beshikwiya bakendi eti, “Pasa mpondalamutuma nkamubulile mpotomona, cola nambi nkwabilo nomba nicani ncomwapengapo?”</para>
  <para style="q">Balo balakumbuleti, “Kuliyawa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Lino walabambileti, “Muntu uliyense ukute mpotomona nambi cola, anyamune. Neye uyo wabula mupeni, aulishe byakufwala byakendi kwambeti aule mupeni. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Cakubinga celela kwinshika calalembwa Mumabala eti, ‘Neye balamubelengela pamo ne babwipishi.’ Ndamwambilingeti Mabala aya alenshikinga cancinencine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Beshikwiya balambeti, “Kamubona Mwami tukute bibeshi bibili,” Yesu walabakumbuleti, “Ni ningi byopelebyo.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapailinga mulibala lya Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateyo 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesu walafumamo mu Yelusalemu nekuya ku mulundu wa maolifi mbuli ncalikwinsa lyonse. Naboyo beshikwiya bakendi balamukonkela. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mpwalashika pamusena uyo Yesu walabambileti, “Kamupailani kwambeti mutengila mumasunko.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabashiya, walendako pang'ana walafukama nekupaila. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Bata, na musuni kamufunyani nkomeshi ya mapensho iyi. Necikabeco mutensa kuyanda kwakame, nsombi mwinse kuyanda kwenu.” <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lino mungelo wakwilu walesa kumuyuminisha. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Pacebo cakupenshewa mumoyo, walapaila cangofu kupita pakutanguna. Lino inkasalo yakendi yalikubeti mandondo a milopa alakanga panshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Mpwalafuma akupaila walabwelela kuli beshikwiya bakendi. Walacana nkabalibona pacebo ca miyeyo, <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Nipacebo cini mona tulo? Kamupundukani mupaile kwambeti mutengila mumasunko.”</para>
  <para style="s">Kwikatwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyo 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Yohane 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesu nkacamba, likoto lya bantu, lyalesa kalili lyatanguninwa ne Yudasi, umo wabeshikwiya likumi nebabili. Walesa pepi walamupa mutende ne kumushonshota. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walamwambileti, “Yudasi, sena ulayabanga Mwana Muntu kupitila mukumushonshota?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Lino beshikwiya balikuba ne Yesu mpobalabona calikwinshika balepusha Yesu eti, “Mwami, Se tubayase ne bibeshi?” <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lino umo wa beshikwiya walatimbula litwi lya kululyo lya musebenshi wa mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Nsombi Yesu walambeti, “Cilekeni kwinseco.” Popelapo Yesu walekata litwi lya muntu uyo nekumushilika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesu walambila bonse abo balesa kumwikata, bamakulene ba beshimilumbo nebamukulene baba kamulonda ba Ng'anda ya Lesa, kayi nebamakulene ba Bayuda. Walabepusheti, “Sena mulenshi kwisa ne mipeni nemingwala eti nde kapondo? <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ndalikuba nenjamwe mu Ng'anda ya Lesa lyonse, nomba muliya kunjikatapo. Lino cino cindi nicenu ca ngofu sha mwami wa mushinshe.”</para>
  <para style="s">Petulo lakananga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-58">Mateyo 26:57-58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-54">Maliko 14:53-54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Yohane 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Lino balekata Yesu nekumutwala kung'anda ya mukulene wa beshimilumbo bonse. Neye Petulo walikakonkela Yesu capatali. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Lino balakunka mulilo pakati palubansa lwang'anda, bonse balekala panshi pamo. Neye Petulo walekala pakati pabo. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Lino mutukashi umo wa basebenshi mpwalabona Petulo kayota mulilo wamulangishisha, ne kwambeti, “Uyu neye walikuba ne Yesu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Nsombi Petulo nendi walakana nekwambeti, “Sobwe obe mutukashi nkandimwinshipo uyu ame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Mpopalapita kacindi kang'ana mutuloba naumbi neye walamubona Petulo nekumwambileti, “Obe njobe umo wabasa.”</para>
  <para style="p">Nomba Petulo walakumbuleti, “Ntamepo sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mpopalapita kacindi kanda kukwana ola umo naumbi muntu walamba cangofu eti, “Nicakubinga muntu uyu walikuba ne Yesu pakwinga nimwine Galileya.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Petulo walakumbuleti, “Ayo makani ngolambanga nkandainshi ame nambi pang'ana.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lino petulo kacamba, kombwe walalila. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Mwami Yesu walafutatuka nekulangilisha Petulo. Lino nendi Petulo walanuka maswi a Mwami Yesu ngalamwambileti, “Kombwe nkatana alila lelo, obe Petulo nunkane mankanda atatu.” <verse number="62" style="v"/>Lino Petulo walafuma pansa, walalila cebo ca cikonko ncali kukute mumoyo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamusekenga mwalisongwe ne kumuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67-68">Mateyo 26:67-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Maliko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Lino bantu balikulonda Yesu, balatatika kumuseka nekumuma. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Balamufweka pamenso, balamuma nekumwipusheti, “Lotela, nomba niyani lakumu?” <verse number="65" style="v"/>Kayi balamba maswi angi akumucobola.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamutwalanga kunkuta ya Bayuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateyo 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yohane 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Mpobwalaca bamakulene ba Bayuda, ne beshimilumbo, kayi ne beshikwiyisha Milawo balabungana. Balamumanta Yesu nekuya nendi kunkuta yabo. <verse number="67" style="v"/>Balamwipusheti, “Twambile na njobe Mupulushi Walaiwa usa.” Nsombi nendi walabakumbuleti, “Nambi ndimwambile, nteshi mushome sobwe, <verse number="68" style="v"/>na ndimwipushe mwipusho, nteshi munkumbulepo. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Kufuma lelo ame nde Mwana Muntu nimbenga ndekala kulikasa lyakululyo kwa Lesa wangofu shonse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Lino bonse balepusheti, “Sena ulambangeti njobe Mwanendi Lesa?” Neye walakumbuleti, “Ee njame mbuli ncomulamba mobene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Balo balambeti, “Sena lino inga katuciyandola nabambi bakamboni? Tulalinyufwili kendi ncalamba mwine.”</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamutwalanga kuli Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateyo 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yohane 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balanyamuka, nekutwala Yesu kuli Pilato. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lino balatatika kumubepeshela Yesu eti, “Twalamucana muntu uyu kayungaula bantu ba mushobo wetu. Walikwambila bantu eti tucileke kusonka musonko kuli mwami wa ku Loma. Kayi ukute kwambeti ni Mupulushi Walaiwa kayi eti emwami.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Lino Pilato walamwipusha Yesu eti, “Sena njobe, Mwami wa ba Yuda?”</para>
  <para style="p">Yesu walakumbuleti, “Mulamba mobene.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pilato walambila bamakulene beshimilumbo nebantu bonse basa eti, “Ame kuliya mulandu ngondacana pa muntu uyu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nsombi balo balayuminina kumubepeshela kabambeti, “Layungaulunga ne kufulunganya bantu pakwiyisha kwakendi mucishi conse ca Yudeya. Walatatikila ku Galileya lino mpaka lashiki ne kuno.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu balamutwalanga kuli Helodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pilato mpwalanyumfweco walepusheti, “Sena uyu muntu nimwine Galileya?” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino mpwalanyumfwa kwambeti Yesu ukute kufuma mucishi ncalikwendelesha Helode, walamutuma kuli Helode uyo walikuba mu Yelesalemu pa cindico. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Helode mpwalabona Yesu walakondwa, pakwinga lyonse walikunyumfwa mbili yakendi. Neco walikuyanda kumubona. Walikuyandishisha kwambeti akamubonepo kensa cikankamanisho. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Neco Helode walamwipusha mipusho ingi, nsombi Yesu nendi liya kumukumbulapo ciliconse. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bamakulene beshimilumbo ne beshikwiyisha ba Milawo balesa pepi nekutatika kumubepesha cangofu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Helode nebashilikali bakendi balamuseka Yesu ne kumunyansha. Lino balamufwalika cakufwala cabwami, nekumubwesha kuli Pilato. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kufuma busuba ubo Helode ne Pilato balatatika kunyumfwana pakwinga balikuba bapatana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapingulweti ashinwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateyo 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohane 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino Pilato walabunganya bamakulene beshimilumbo ne beshikwendelesha kayi ne bantu bonse. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Lino walabambileti, “Uyu muntu mulamulete kuli njameti nkayungaula bantu, lino ame ndamwipushu mwense kamulipo, ndacana kwambeti liya mulandu pamakani onse ngomwa mwambanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Helode neye liya kucanapo mulandu pali uyu muntu, weco neye lamubweshe kuli afwe. Kamubona uyu muntu liya kwinsapo mulandu wakufwilapo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco ndimukwipowa ne kumusungulula.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nomba Pilato lyonse walikubasungululila kayili umo pabusuba bwa Pasika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nsombi bonse bantu balolobesha pamo eti, “Ashinwe muntu uyu, mutusungwilile Balabasi.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Balabasi uyu walasungwa pakwinga walapanga cimfulunganya mucishi ne kushina bantu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi Pilato walikuyanda kumusungulula Yesu, neco walamba nabo bantu basa kayi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba nabo balolobesheti, “Mupopeni palusanda! Mupopeni!”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilato walabambila bantu kabutatu eti, nomba lenshi cani caipa uyu? Ame ndacana kwambeti liya mulandu ngwelakufwilapo. Neco ndimukwipowa nekumusungulula.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nsombi bonse bayuminina kolobesheti, “Welela kupopwa palusanda.” Lino Pilato walakomwa kumaswi ayo. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Neco Pilato walapingula kwelana ne ncobalikusenga bantu baseti cinshike. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Pilato walasungulula Balabasi uyo walaleta cimfulunganya nekushina bantu ngobalasenga. Yesu bamwinse kwelana mbuli kuyanda kwabo.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lapopwanga pa lusanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyo 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohane 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bashilikali balamumanta Yesu kwambeti benga bamupope. Balakumana ne Shimoni waku Kulene, nkafuma muminshi. Balamwikata nekumunyamwisha lusanda kwambeti akonkenga panyuma pa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Bantu bangi balikumukonkela. Pakati pabo palikuba batukashi bali kabalila nekunyumfwa kwipilwa pacebo ca Yesu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walapilibuka ne kubambileti, “Amwe mobatukashi ba ku Yelusalemu mutalilila ame sobwe, nsombi mulilile mobene kayi ne bana benu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Pakwinga masuba nakashike bantu mpoti bakambengeti, ‘Bakute colwe batukashi balabula kusemapo nekuyamwishapo!’ <verse number="30" style="v"/>Pacindico nibakasenge malundu eti, ‘Kamutuwila’ Kayi netucina eti, ‘Tufwekeleleni.’ <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nomba lino na kulico kulinjame ndecitondo catontola, nomba nikukabeconi kuli njamwe mobitondo byayuma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Balamanta ba kapondo babili kwambeti benga bapopwe pamo ne Yesu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mpobalashika kumusena walikukwiweti cifupa ca mutwi, balapopa Yesu palusanda. Kopeloko balapopako bakapondo basa palusanda, umbi kululyo naumbi kucipiko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesu walambeti, “Ta, kamubalekelela pakwinga nkabacinshi ncobalenshinga.”</para>
  <para style="p">Lino balensa nsolo nekuyabana byakufwala byakendi. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bantu balikuba bemana popelapo kabebela. Nomba bamakulene ba Bayuda abo kabaweluluka Yesu nekwambeti, “Walapulusha bambi, lino neye alipulushe mwine, na ni Mupulushi uyo Walaiwa ne Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bashilikali naboyo balamuseka, balesa pepi nekumupa waini wasasa eti anwe. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nekumwambileti, “Na njobe Mwami wa Bayuda, lipulushe omwine.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Pelu palusanda palikuba palembweti, “Uyu emwami wa ba Yuda.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kapondo umo walikuba wapopwa pamo ne Yesu, walamucobola Yesu eti, “Sena ntobe mupulushi washomeshewa? Lipulushe nenjafwe utupulushe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Nsombi umbi walakalilila munendi nekumwambileti, “Sena obe nkotini Lesa? Tulapopwa pamo twense mu mapensho. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nsombi afwe tobabili twelela kupopwa pakwinga tulatambulunga cilambo celela pa bintu mbyotwalikwinsa. Lino uyu neye kuliya caipa ncalensapo.” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Lino walambila Yesu eti “Mukanganuke mwakesa mu Bwami bwenu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walamwambileti, “Cakubinga ndakwambilinga lelo, nukekale nenjame mu Paladaiso.”</para>
  <para style="s">Lufu Lwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateyo 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohane 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lino cindi mpocalashika pa 12 koloko, kwalaba mushinshe pacishi conse kushikila 3 koloko, <verse number="45" style="v"/>lino cikwisa calikucala mu Ng'anda ya Lesa calatwamuka pakati. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walolobesha ne liswi lya pelu eti, “Ta mushimu wakame ndaubiki mumakasa enu.” Mpwalapwisha kwambeco, walafwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Mukulene wa bashilikali mpwalaboneco, walalumbaisha Lesa, ne kwambeti, “Nicakubinga uyu muntu walikuba walulama.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Naboyo bantu bangi balikuba babungana kabebela, mpobalabona calenshika balabwelela kumanda kwabo nkabayakulyuma pantiti ne kungumana. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Bantu bonse balikumwinshiba Yesu, ne batukashi basa balamukonkela baku Galileya, balemana patali kababona byonse byalenshika.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labikwanga mumanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyo 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohane 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kwalikuba muntu walikukwiweti Yosefe walikwikala mumushi wa Alimateya mucishi ca Yudeya. Walikuba umo wamulibunga lya Nkuta inene ya Bayuda, walikuba muntu uli cena walemekwa <verse number="51" style="v"/>nendi wali kupembelela kwisa kwa Bwami bwa Lesa. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Uyu muntu walaya ku musenga Pilato citumbi ca Yesu. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Lino walaselusha citumbi palusanda ne kupombela mucikwisa caina, walamubika mu cumbwe ca mulibwe umo mwalikuba mutana mubikwapo muntu uliyense. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Bwalikuba busuba bwakulibambila pakwinga busuba bwa Sabata bwalikuba pepi kutatika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Batukashi baku Galileya basa balikukonkela Yesu balaya ne Yosefe akubona cumbwe mwalabika citumbi ca Yesu. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Balabwelela ku ng'anda a kubamba mafuta anunkila cena.</para>
  <para style="p">Lino pabusuba bwa Sabata, balapumwina kwelana ne Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kupunduka kwa Yesu kufuma kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mateyo 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohane 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino mumenemene pa busuba bwa pa Sondo, batukashi abo balanyamuna mafuta ne byanunkila mbyobalabamba kuya kucumbwe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Balacana libwe lyakunkulushiwapo pacishinga ca cumbwe.<figure style="fig" desc="" file="16 Tomb.jpg" size="col" loc="" copy="" ref="24:2">Libwe lilakunkulushiwanga kufuma pa cumbwe</figure> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nomba mpobalengila mucumbwe baliya kucanamo citumbi ca Mwami Yesu. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kabacikankamana, balabonowa bantu babili balikuba bafwala byakufwala byabekema kabali bemana pepi nabo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Batukashi abo balatina nekukotama panshi. Lino bantu abo balabepusheti, “Mulamulangwelinga cani muntu muyumi pakati pa bafu? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkalimo muno, lapunduku. Kamwanuka maswi ngalamwambila mpwalikuba ku Galileya. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Eti Mwana Muntu welela kuyabwa mumakasa a bantu baipa, nekupopwa palusanda, nekupunduka kubafu pakapita masuba atatu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Popelapo batukashi basa balanuka maswi aya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpobalafuma kucumbwe kusa, balambila beshikwiya likumi ne umo kayi ne bantu bambi bonse. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Abo batukashi balikuba Maliya wa ku Magadala, ne Yohana ne Maliya banyina Jemusi. Balo ne batukashi bambi balikubapo balambila batumwa makani aya. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nsombi maswi ayo kubeshikwiya alaboneka eti nikutamokowa, neco baliya kubashoma batukashi abo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nsombi nendi Petulo walanyamuka nekufwambilako kucumbwe. Mpwalashika walabonowa muli bikwisa byonka, walabwelela kung'anda kali wakankamana pabintu byalenshika.</para>
  <para style="s">Byaleshika panshila ya ku Emausi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Maliko 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pabusuba ubo beshikwiya babili balikuya kumunshi walikukwiweti Emausi. Mushinso wa kufuma ku Emausi kushika ku Yelusalemu walikuba wa makilomita akwana likumi ne limo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Mpobalikuya munshila bali kababandika pa bintu ibyo byonse byalenshika. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kabacibandika nekwipushanya, Yesu mwine walesa pepi ne kwendela pamo nabo. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Balamubona nomba baliya kumwinshiba. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesu walabepusheti, “Nimakani cini ngomulenga nkamubandikilana?”</para>
  <para style="p">Lino nabo balemana kayi cinso cabo nkacili calaka nemapensho, <verse number="18" style="v"/>lino umbi walikukwiweti kileopasi walamwipusheti, “Sena njobe mwensu wenka mu Yelusalemu utenshi byalenshika masuba apita kunyuma?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesu walepusheti, “Byamushobocini?” Lino balakumbuleti. Sha Yesu wa ku Nasaleti. Uyo muntu walikuba munshinshimi wali kwinsa bintu byangofu pamenso a Lesa ne bantu bonse. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nsombi bamakulene beshimilumbo ne bakulene betu bambi balamutwala kwambeti apewe mulandu wakushinwa, kufumapo balamupopa palusanda. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nsombi afwe twalikuba twengashila kwambeti nakalubule ba Isilaeli. Lino palapiti masuba atatu kufuma mpobyenshika byonse ibi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Lino kayi batukashi nabambi pakati petu balatukankamanisha. Nabo balaya kucumbwe mumene mene, <verse number="23" style="v"/>lino mubili wakendi baliya kucanamo. Mpobalabwela balambeti balabono bangelo abo balabambileti Yesu nimuyumi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Bambi mulikoto lyetu balaya kucumbwe ne kucana mbuli ncobalamba batukashi basa, nabo baliya kumubona Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabambileti, “Amwe mobantu baluya, bakute kubula kuyanda kushoma bwangu bintu byonse byalamba bashinshimi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Sena nkamucinshi kwambeti mupulushi walaiwa usa walikwelela kunyumfwa byeshikubaba byonse ibi kwambeti engile mubulemu bwakendi?” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Lino walabasansulwila byonse byalembwa mumalembo onse, kutatikila mumabuku a Mose mpaka ku bashinshimi bonse bilambanga palyendiye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mpobalashika pepi ne Yelusalemu, Yesu walenseti lapitililinga. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nsombi beshikwiya abo balamukakatisha ne kwambeti, “Kamwikalani nenjafwe pakwinga kulashipi, bonani lisuba lilenga akwibila.” Neco walengila mung'anda ne kwikala nabo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mpwalekala nabo pakulyela, Yesu walamanta shinkwa, walalumba Lesa, Kayi walakomona nekubayabila. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Popelapo menso abo alacaluka. Lino balamwinshiba popelapo walashimanganowa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Lino balatatika kwambilaneti, “Cancine ncine maswi akendi ayasanga mumoyo mpwatwambilanga munshila pasa, nekupandulula mabala.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kufumapo balanyamuka nekubwelela ku Yelusalemu, uko nkobalacana beshikwiya likumi ne umo kabali babungana pamo nebanabo, <verse number="34" style="v"/>kabambeti, “Nicakubinga Mwami lapunduku kubafu, labonekele kuli Shimoni.” <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lino naboyo babili basa, balasansulula calenshika munshila mpobalamwinshiba Mwami mpwalabakomwena shinkwa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu labonekelenga kubeshikwiya bakendi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyo 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohane 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Incito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Kabacamba babili abo, Yesu mwine walashika nekwimana pakati pabo bonse ne kwambeti, “lumuno lube nenjamwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Balo balatilimuka nekutina pakwinga balayeyeti balabononga cipuku. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Nendi walabambileti, “Nomba mulapengelenga cani ne kutoshana mumyoyo mwenu? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kamubona makasa nebimpanta byakame, kwambeti njame. Kamunjikata munyumfwe pakwinga cipuku ciliya musuni nebifupa mbuli mbyomulabonongeti ndibikute ame.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Lino mpwalambeco walababonesha makasa nebimpanta byakendi. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nabo baliya kushoma pakwinga balikuba bakondwa, kayi ne kukankamana. Lino walabepusheti, “Sena mukutepo byakulya pano?” <verse number="42" style="v"/>Balamupa cipansha ca nswi yakuyoka. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Walacitambula ne kulya bonse nkababonako.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Lino walabambileti, “Ibi ebintu byondamwambila mpondalikuba nenjamwe. Pasa ndalikwambeti byonse byalembwa pali njame mu Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose, ne mumabuku abashinshimi, ne mulibuku lya kutembaula.” <verse number="45" style="v"/>Lino walabanyafwa kwambeti banyufwishishe Mabala. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Walabambileti, “Byalalembwa nibi; Mupulushi welela kupenshewa ne kupunduka kubafu pabusuba bwabutatu. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kwambeti mulina lyakendi Mulumbe Waina ukakambaukwe kubantu ba mishobo yonse, kutatikila ku Yelusalemu. Kwambeti basanduke mumoyo benseco neye Lesa empwela kubalekelela bwipishi bwabo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Amwe mobakamboni pabintu ibi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ninkamutumine cipo ico Bata ncobalashomesha, nsombi mwelela kwikala mumunshi muno kushikila mukatambule ngofu sheti shikafume kwilu.”</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu lenga kwilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliko 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Incito 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Lino Yesu walabatangunina kufuma mumunshi umo kuya kushika ku Betaniya. Kopeloko walatambika makasa akendi nekubaleleka. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Lino kacibaleleka walapansana nabo, nekumantwa kuya kwilu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Lino balamukambilila, panyuma pakendi balabwelela ku Yelusalemu kabali bakondwa maningi. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Cindi conse balikucanika mu Ng'anda ya Lesa kabalumbaisha Lesa.</para>
</usx>
